<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muzimbu uacili uasonekele Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muzimbu uacili uasonekele</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Muzimbu ua Luka, unapu umo ua mikanda iuana ya Mulitavasano Lialihia uje ulumbununa vuyoye vua Yesu Kilistu. Umo na umo ua mikanda eyi vaitumbula nguavo “muzimbu.” kulumbununa nguavo “mizimbu ya cili.” Vaisonekele hanima ya kutsa kua Yesu kuli Mateu, Mako, Luka na Iuano. Luka kasonekele lika vimpande via vuyoye vua Yesu, vuno honi ua sonekele naua na vilinga vivalingile va ndongisi va Yesu hanima ya kutsa na kusanguka cendi, uavisonekele mu mukanda ua Vilinga via Tunganda. Naumo uahi atantekeya ntsimbu vene Muzimbu ua Luka vausonekele cipue ku vausonekelele, vuno honi vavengi vakakulilongesa cikuma valivuasana nguavo kumoneka vausonekele mu muaka ua 70 AD. Mukanda ua Luka vausonekele kuli ikeye Luka ou naua uapuile ndotolo. Mucifua mua u sonekelelemo nomu muanalikuaseselamo muyati cimonesa nguavo uapuile yala uakulilongesa cikuma. Luka uatondele kulumbununa muacili, kuhandeka vilinga omo mu vialingiuilemo, linga vakuavo vauaneneho vukuasi omo vautanda (Luka 1: 1-3). Kapuile ka Yunda (Makolose 4: 10-14) kaha uasonekele linga nava keti ma Yunda vovuisise. Eci camoneka hakutoka to muana lumbunuinamo cisemua ca ma Yunda (Luka 1: 8). Muzimbu ua Luka ua lifu cikuma na mikanda ya Mateu na Mako, omuo ilumbununa viuma vimo via kulifua. Hamikanda itatu eyi, Luka ikeye lika yana handekaho cikuma ha kusemuka kua Iuano mu kakumbuitika. Luka nahandeka naua ha lukonekelo (Kapetulu 3: 3, 11:4, 17: 3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na lilombelo (3: 21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Muanatumbikilamo mukanda muvuihi:</para>
  <para style="io1">Cinimbu 1: 1-4, Luka ahandeka ha Muzimbu uendi na kulumbununa vika linga ausoneke.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaha alumbununa kusemuka kua Yesu nomu muva muvuaheselele cipangi cendi (1:5;4:13).</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaha mutambela ua kama uoshe ua Muzimbu (4:14; 21:38), Luka ahandeka ha vipangi vije Yesu ualingile, cikumani ha vikomouesa via lingile na viuma via longesele.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mukumanesa, havinimbu via kumanesela vivali (22-24), hali nakulumbununa omo Yesu muatsile, muva mutsindile, nomu muasangukile kuvatsi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s">Majui akulivanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Vantu vavengi vanesekele kusoneka vukaleho vua viuma vije vialishulisilile hhakati ketu. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Vantu vamo vamuene vukaleho vua viuma evi hume hambangelo. Vapangelele Njambi mukulekesa vantu Muzimbu uendi. Vantu ava vahanene vimpande vije viapangahalele kuli yetu. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Nankuma, nange njinayongola nguange njapande kukusonenavio yove mukuluntu Telefilo muvialikavelele, omuo njinavivuisisa vioshe hume havia putukilile. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Njapanga evi linga utantekeye vusunga vuacili vua viuma vije vivakulongesele.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vambulula kusemuka kua Iuano Muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Ha matangua a Helonde, muene ua Nganda ya Yundeya, kuakele kasasendote lizina liendi Zakaliya, ua kumuyati ua tusasendote va Aviya. Lizina lia mpuevo yendi liapuile Elizaveta, nendi naua uapuile uaku ntanga ya Alone. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Voshe vapuile vaka vusunga ku mesho a Njambi, vendele muacili na kuononoka Mashiko oshe a Muene Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Vuno honi vakevo kuvakele na muana omuo Elizaveta uapuile ntsimpi, kaha voshe vavali vapuile vakulukazi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ha litangua limo Zakaliya uakele nakupanga vipangi viendi via vusasendote mu njivo ya Muene Njambi, omuo yapuile ntsimbu yendi yahete ya kupanga. <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>Ngue kucilika civakavele tusasendote, Zakaliya vamuhanguile hakuta nkela linga akovele Kumutambele Uakulela cikuma mu njivo ya Muene Njambi nakutsimika insense ha mutula. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Ha ntsimbu Zakaliya uakele na kutsimika insense, civunga ca vantu vakele hambanza na kulombela, <verse eid="LUK 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>kaha kuamusholokelele kangelo ka Muene Njambi, uemanene kucilio ca mutula uakutsimikila insense. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Omo Zakaliya uamumuene uaniangumukile, kaha uovuile liova. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Vuno honi Kangelo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti uvue liova Zakaliya! Njambi novu lilombelo liove. Mpuevo yove Elizaveta akakusemena muana ua yala, kaha ukamuluka lizina liendi Iuano. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Ukavuahelela na kujolela, kaha vavengi vakalisamba ha kusemuka cendi! <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Ou muana akapua uakama ku mesho a Muene Njambi. Kakanu viniu cipue viuma viakushasha vije vipendesa. Hume kanda asemuke na ha kusemuka cendi Cimbembesi ca Kulela cika mutuamenena. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Kaha akahiluisila vantu vavengi va Isaleli kuli Muene Njambi yavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Akaya kulutue lua Muene, ngue ku nzili na cifua ca vilinga via Eliya kananguizi ua Njambi. Akahiluisa vaishavo na vana vavo hamolika. Akatengulula vaka kuhona kuononoka na kuvahiluisila naua kungila yakuyongola ngue vaka vusunga. Akavuahesela vualumo vantu linga vavandamene Muene.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Kaha Zakaliya uehuile kangelo nguendi, “Njikatantekeya vatihoni nga cuma eci mucikapua? Omuo yange njinakolo laja, kaha naua mpuevo yange nakolo laja.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Kaha kangelo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yange Ngambiliyele njinemana ku mesho a Njambi. Nanjitumu kuhandeka nove nakukunehela muzimbu ou uacili. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Tolilila honi ukapua u kaveveve omuo kuua kulahelele mezi ange, aje akapua a vusunga omo ntsimbu yauo ikaheta. Ukaholoka kuluu noho litangua lije likulaheso liange kuli yove likapua lia vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Vantu vavandamena Zakaliya hambanza kaha valikomokelele cikuma omo uasimbuile cikuma mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Omo Zakaliya uatuhukilemo kasele kuhandeka kuli vakevo. Kaha hakuhona kuhandeka lizi limo, uapangesele vitantekeyeso na mavoko endi, kaha vantu vakele hambanza vatantekeyele nguavo namono cimona mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Zakaliya omo uamanesele vipangi viendi mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi, kaha uahilukile kunjivo yendi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Munima yevi mpuevo yendi Elizaveta uakele na lizimo, uakele mu njivo vingonde vitanu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Kaha Elizaveta uahandekele nguendi, “Hakukotoka Muene Njambi nanjimuesa kavumbi, nanjihumisa shuamua ku mesho a vantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kangelo Ngambiliyele ambulula kusemuka kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Omo Elizaveta uakele na vingonde vitanu na imo via lizimo, Njambi uatumine kangelo Ngambiliyele aye ku Nazaleta mu nganda ya Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>Kangelo uakele na lizi kuli muana mpuevo umo kanda alimone na yala lizina liendi Maliya. Uje uapuile uakulama kuli yala lizina liendi Yosefa, uaku ntanga ya muene Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Kaha kangelo uezile kuli Maliya uamumenekele na kuhandekele nguendi, “Muene hali nove, kaha nakukuisula cikuma!” <verse eid="LUK 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Maliya uakele na citanga ha lizi lije liahandekele kangelo, uasinganiekele mu mutima uendi nguendi, “Majui aua analumbunuka vika?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Kaha kangelo uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti uvue liova Maliya, omuo unauana kavumbi kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Tala, ukakala na lizimo, kaha ukasema muana ua yala, ukamuluka lizina liendi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Ou muana akapua uakama, kaha vakamutumbula Muna Njambi ua helu lia vioshe. Kaha Muene Njambi akamupuisa muene, ngue muapuile kukuyendi Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Kaha akapua muene ua miyati ya Yakomba kumiaka yoshe, na vumuene vuendi kuvukahu!”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Kaha Maliya uahandekele kuli kangelo nguendi, “Eci cikapua vati? Omuo yange njimuana mpuevo uje kanda alimone na yala.” <verse eid="LUK 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Kaha kangelo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Cimbembesi ca Kulela cikeja hali yove, na nzili ya Njambi Uakuhiana ikakufuika. Nankuma, ha cuma eci uje muana Uakulela vakamutumbula Muna Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Tala! Munanoko Elizaveta na ikeye nemita muana ua yala muvukuluntu vuendi. Kaha ino inapu ngonde ya mucitanu na imo ya lizimo liendi cipue vene vamutumbuile nguavo ntsimpi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Omuo cuma nacimo cahi cahona Njambi kulinga.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Kaha Maliya uakumbuluile kangelo nguendi, “Yange njinapu njingamba ya Muene Njambi, cilingiue kuli yange ngue munahandekela.” Kaha munima yevi kangelo uamusezele.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliya Ameneka Elizaveta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Hanima ya matangua amandende, Maliya ualivuaheselele na kuya ku mbonge ya mu minkinda ya mu nganda ya Yundeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Omo uahete kaha uakovelele mu njivo ya Zakaliya, kaha uahinduisile Elizaveta. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Omo Elizaveta uovuile kuhinduisa ca Maliya, kaha kakeke uaniangumukile muzimo liendi. Kaha Elizaveta uashulile na Cimbembesi ca Kulela, <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>kaha uahandekele na lizi liakama nguendi, “Yove uakukuisula hhakati ka vampuevo voshe, nakuisuliua muana uje iukasema!” <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Omuo vikahoni cuma cakama eci cilingiua kuli yange, ngeci vaina ya Muene yange veje kuli yange? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Tala! Omo vene njovuile lizi liakuhinduisa kuove, haje vene kakeke muzimo liange uaniangumukile na kujolela. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Yove uuakukuisula omuo uakutsiliela ngeci lizi lia Muene Njambi kuli yove likapua lia vusunga!<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muaso ua vishangala ua Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maliya uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mutima uange ushangazala vukama vua Muene Njambi,<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Muono uange unavuahelela omuo Njambi Muyoyesi uange,<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>Omuo nanuka yange ngamba yendi uamundende! Kuhuma hano nakuya kulutue, vantu voshe vakanjitumbula nguavo njimukakuvezika,<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Omuo Njambi muka nzili yoshe nanjilingila viakama. Lizina liendi lia kulela.<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>Ikeye akamuesa cikeketima kuli voshe vamusingimika, kuhuma kucisemua cimo kutuala ku cisemua cikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Ikeye nolola livoko liendi lia nzili, nashandula vaka viyongola via kulihalesa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Nahumisa vamiene vakama ha matanda avo, kaha nahaka vaje vavandende kuvukama.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Nalisa vaje vali na njala na viakulia viacili, kaha vaka kufuka navasheke mavoko voko.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Ikeye naniungu likulaheso lije lia lingile na vakuluntu vetu, kaha neja nakukuasa ngamba yendi Isaleli.<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>Nanuka kumuesa cikeketima kuli Avilahama naku vikota viendi vioshe ku miaka yoshe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Kaha Maliya uasikamene na Elizaveta vingote vitatu, kaha uahilukile kuimbo liavo.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusemuka kua Iuano muka kumbuitika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Ntsimbu ya Elizaveta yakutota yahete kaha uapapele muana uayala. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Vandambo na vavushoko vendi vovuile muje Muene Njambi muanamumuesa ngozi yakama, kaha voshe vavuahelelele hamo nendi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Kaha ha litangua lia mucitanu na atatu, vezile nakutuhula muana ku mukanda, vatondele kumuhindula ishe Zakaliya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Vuno honi vaina vahandekele nguavo, “houe! Mulukeni Iuano.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Kukuesi kavushoko kove ivaluka lizina eli!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Kaha vaniatele ishe na kulinga vitantekeyeso na mavoko avo ku muihula nguavo, “Lizina muka utonda kuluka munove?”<verse eid="LUK 1:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Kaha Zakaliya ualombele citale asonekeho, omo vacinehele uasonekeleho nguendi, “Lizina liendi Iuano.” Kaha voshe vali komokelele cikuma! <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Ha ntsimbu ijevene Zakaliya uasele kuhandeka naua, kaha uaputukile kushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Vandambo voshe vakele na liova, kaha muzimbu ua uatsimanene ku mutambela uoshe ua minkinda mu nganda ya Yundeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Voshe vaje vovuile muzimbu ou vasinganiekeleho, kaha valihozuele nguavo, “Ou kanike akafua vati?” Omuo casholokele muacili ngeci nzili ya Muene Njambi yakele hali ikeye.<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muaso ua Zakaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Ishe ya Iuano, Zakaliya, uashulile na Cimbembesi ca kulela, kaha uahandekele vimpande vije Njambi uamusholuelele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 1:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Kalemeso kuli Muene Njambi ya Isaleli! Neja nakukuasa vantu vendi na kuvapatula. <verse eid="LUK 1:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Natuhana muyoyesi ua nzili, mutekulu ua ngamba yendi Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 1:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>Uakulahesele laja muli tunanguizi va Njambi vendi va kulela <verse eid="LUK 1:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>linga vakatuamene ku nzili ya vitozi vetu voshe vaje vatuzinda. <verse eid="LUK 1:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Ualingile eci kumuesa cikeketima kuli vakukuluila vetu na kushulisilila litavasano liendi lia kulela. <verse eid="LUK 1:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>Eci cikeco cisingo cije ca lisingile na cisemi cetu Avilahama. <verse eid="LUK 1:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>Uakulahesele kutuohiela ku mavoko avitozi vetu, linga tukamupangele cakuhona liova, <verse eid="LUK 1:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>linga tupue vakulela na vaka vusunga ku mesho endi ku matangua oshe a muono uetu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Kaha yove munange, vakakutumbula kananguizi ka Njambi uahelu lia vioshe. Kaha ukatuama kulutue lua Muene muku vuahesa ngila yendi, <verse eid="LUK 1:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>nakuleka vantu vendi ngeci vakavovola haku vakonekela ku vupi vuavo. <verse eid="LUK 1:77"/><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>Omuo Njambi yetu uakala na cikeketima cakama akatumenekela ngue litangua lituhuka kuhuminina kuilu. <verse eid="LUK 1:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>Akatuila ceke kuli voshe vaje vanatumama mu milima na mucimbembe ca kutsa, nakutuamenena mikono yetu mu ngila ya ciyulo.” <verse eid="LUK 1:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Iuano uakolele mu muvila na mu Cimbembesi. Uakele mu mpambo noho litangua liendi lia kulisholola lia hete ku vantu va Isaleli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kusemuka kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateu1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Capuile ngacije ha ntsimbu ije, kuli Sezale Angushitu kua humine lizi lia kushika, linga vasonekese voshe vantu mu vumuene vua Maloma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Eci kusoneka cije ca katete civa lingile omo Kiliniu uapuile nguvulu ua Silia. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Kaha voshe vaile ku membo avo, va kavasonekeleko.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Kaha Yosefa uahumine ku mbonge ya Nazaleta mu nganda ya Ngalileya, uaile ku mbonge ya Mbetehema mu Yundeya ku limbo lia semukilile Muene Ndaviti, muomu uapuile muka muyati ua Ndaviti. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Uaile nakumusoneka hamo na Maliya uje ya lamene ikeye, uje uakele na lizimo. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Capuile ngacije omo vakele kuje matangua endi a kutota a hete. <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>Kaha uapapele munendi ua ntuatua ua yala, kaha ua muzengelele ha ntanga, kaha uamu hakele mu cikasa ca kulila vangombe muomu kukuakele cihela cavo cakukala.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tungelo vasholoka kuli Tuniungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Ku mutambela uje vene kuakele tuniungi mucana, vakelenakuniuka vampanga vavo vutsiki. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kuli vakevo, kaha vumpau vua Muene vuatuile ceke hhakati kavo. Vovuile liova liakama cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Kangelo uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Keti muvue liova! Omo njinaneha Muzimbu Uacili kuli yeni, uje ukaneha kujolela cakama kuli vantu voshe. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Vutsiki vunovene mu mbonge ya Ndaviti munasemuka Muyoyesi ueni, ikeye Kilistu Muene! <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Kaha eci cikapua cizivukiso ceni, mukauana kakeke vanamuzengela ha vintanga vana mulangeka mu cikasa caku lila vangombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Hajevene kuasholokele civunga cakama ca masualale ca tungelo va muilu vemanene hamo na kangelo uje uanehele muzimbu, vembile na kulemesa Njambi nguavo,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Vumpau kuli Njambi ua muilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">ciyulo cikale hano ha mavu kuli vantu vaje valema!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Omo tungelo vahilukile muilu kuhuma kuli tuniungi, kaha tuniungi valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Tuyeni honi ku Mbetehema linga tuka mone eci cuma cinalingiuako, cije cana tusholuela Muene.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Nankuma, vaile hajevene vuasi vuasi vakauanene Maliya na Yosefa na kakeke vana mulangeka mucikasa caku lila vangombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Omo tuniungi vamumuene, vambuluile mezi aje avalekele kangelo hali kakeke. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Kaha voshe vaje vovuile valikomokelele ha viuma vije vivahandekele tuniungi. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Vuno honi Maliya uaniungile mezi oshe aje naku uayongola mu mutima uendi. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Kaha tuniungi vahilukile na kushangazala na kulemesa Njambi ha viuma vioshe voviule, na vije vamuene. Viuma vioshe vialingiuile ngue vene muje muavalekele kangelo.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuluka lizina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Omo kunahiti matangua atanu na atatu, omo ntsimbu yahete yakutuhula kakeke ku mukanda, kaha vamulukile lizina liendi Yesu, lizina lije lia mulukile kangelo ntsimbu kanda amuimite.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamutuala mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Kaha omo matangua apuilemo akulilelesa, Yosefa na Maliya valingile ngue ku Lishiko lia Mosesa. Nankuma, vatualele kanike ku Yelusalema linga vaka mukundike kuli Muene Njambi, <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>ngue muvanasoneka mu Lishiko lia Muene Njambi, “Muana uoshe ua ntuatua ua yala vaka mukundike kuli Muene Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Mu Lishiko lia Muene Njambi naua lihandeka ngualio visemi vanapande kukombelela nkombelo ya tute vavali cipue vana va mavembe vavali, eci cikeco civalingile Yosefa na Maliya.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Kaha honi kuakele yala umo mu Yelusalema lizina liendi Simoni. Uapuile muka vusunga kaha naua uazangele Njambi, uavandamanene kuovoka kua Isaleli. Cimbembesi cakulela cakele hali ikeye, <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Kaha vavisholuele kuli ikeye kuli Cimbembesi uakulela kakatsi kuakuhona kumono Kilistu Muene. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Simoni ha kumutuamenena kuli Cimbembesi ca kulela, uakovelele mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi. Omo visemi vanehele kakeke Yesu mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi va mulinge ngue ku Lishiko vatumbikile lia Mosesa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>Simoni uatambuile kakeke mu mavoko endi, uatsatselele kuli Njambi na kuhandeka nguendi,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Vuavuno Muene Njambi unaniungu likulaheso liove kuli yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">vuavuno tava yange ngamba yove njije nakukala nove mu ciyulo,<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>omuo mesho ange anamono Muyoyesi iunatumu.<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>Vantu voshe vakamono kuamena cije ciunavuahesa.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Cikapua ceke cakusholola kuli vaje keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">nakuneha vumpau kuli vantu vove va Isaleli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Ishe na vaina vali komokelele hali vije via handekele Simoni hali Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Kaha Simoni uavakuisuile na kuhandeka kuli Maliya vanaye nguendi, “Tala! kakeke ou vamuhanguile kuli Njambi mukunongesa na kuamena vavengi mu Isaleli. Akapua cimueso ca kuhuma kuli Njambi, cije vantu vavengi vaka muluisa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Cimueso cije vantu vavengi cikamuesa viyongola viavo via kushueka. Kaha yove Maliya vusiua vukatuva mutima uove ngue mukuale uakuhomona.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Kuakele umo kananguizi uamukuluntu ua mpuevo ua ntuluue, lizina liendi Ana muna Fanuele uaku muyati ua Ashele. Uashombokele ha miaka itanu na ivali, <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>kaha honi uapuile ntuluue. Uakele na miaka makumi atanu na atatu na miaka iuana. Ikeye kahumine mu njivo ya Muene Njambi, mutania na vutsiki uakele nakulemesa Njambi ha kuliumina kulia na kulombela. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Ha ntsimbu ijevene uahete kuli Maliya na Yosefa uahanene cikandelela kuli Njambi. uahandekele hali uje muana kuli voshe vaje vavandamenene Njambi mukupatula Yelusalema.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vahiluka ku Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Omo Yosefa na Maliya vamanesele vioshe ngue ku Lishiko lia muene Njambi, vahilukile kuimbo liavo ku Nazaleta mu Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Kaha muana uakolele uakele na nzili. Uakolele mu mana, kaha vikuisulo via Njambi viakele hali ikeye.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hali mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi ha miaka likumi na ivali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Ha muaka na muaka visemi va Yesu vakele nakuya ku Yelusalema ku Ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Omo Yesu uakele na miaka likumi na ivali, kaha vaile nendi ku Yelusalema ku cilika ca ciuano ngue ntsimbu yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Omo matangua aje a ciuano ahuile, kaha vaputukile kuya kuimbo, vuno honi Yesu uasalele munima mu Yelusalema. Visemi vendi kuvatantekeyele, <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>vayonguele nguavo hamo hali ha cendo, nankuma vendele vungezi vua litangua limo, kaha vaputukile kumutonda hhakati kava vushoko vuavo nava vusamba vavo, <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>vuno honi kuva muuanene. Nankuma, vahilukile naua ku Yelusalema na kumutonda. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Kaha ha litangua lia mu citatu vamuuanene mu Njivo ya Muene Njambi, natumama hhakati ka valongisi va mashiko a Njambi, na kuvovuilila naku vehozola vihula. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Kaha voshe vaje vovuile vali komokelele cikuma mangana endi nakukumbulula cendi. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Visemi vendi omo vamumuene valikomokelele, kaha vaina vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Munange, vika unatulingilamo? Tala! Isho nange tunaliniengele na kukutonda cikuma ngeci tukuuane.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vika munanjitondela? Nkuma kumuatantekeyele ngueni njinapande kukala mu njivo ya tate ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Vuno honi vakevo kuvatantekeyele kulumbunuka cakukumbulula cendi.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Kaha Yesu uaile navo ku Nazaleta, kaha kuje uatualeleleho kuvononoka. Vaina vaniungile vioshe evi mu mutima uavo. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Kaha Yesu uakolele mu muvila, na mu mana, uauanene kavumbi kakama kuli Njambi na vantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s">Iuano muka Kumbuitika avuahesa ngila ya Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mako1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Iuano1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Evi vioshe vialingiuile omo Sezale Timbeliase te hanga aciyula ha miaka likumi na itanu mu vumuene vua Loma. Ha ntsimbu ije Pontiyu Pilato uapuile nguvulu uamu Yundeya, na Helonde uasuanene mu Ngalileya, munaina Filipu uasuanene mu nganda ya Ituleya na nganda ya Talakoniti, Lisaniya uasuanene mu nganda ya Ambilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>na Anase na Kayafase vapuile Tusasendote Vakama. Ha ntsimbu ijevene Njambi uahandekele kuli Iuano muna Zakaliya omo uakele mu mpambo. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Kaha Iuano uaile ku cihela na cihela ca Ndonga ya Yundau na kuambulula nguendi, “Tengulukeni ku vupi vueni vamimbuitike, kaha Njambi akamisambesa ku vupi vueni.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Ngue muvana soneka mu livulu lia Isaya kananguizi ua Njambi nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“lizi lia umo atambeka mu mpambo nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Vuaheseni tapalo ya Muene Njambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">sungameseni ngila yendi linga akuhitilemo!<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Vimbongo vioshe vanapande ku viofuela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">minkinda yoshe yakama neyi yaindende vaka viniekumuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">na vingila via kuhenga vanapande kuviolola visungame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na vingila via kuzika vanapande kuvilambesa.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Vantu voshe vakamona kuamena ca Njambi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Kaha Iuano ualekele vije vivunga via vantu vezile kuli ikeye nakuvambuitika nguendi, “Eni manoka! Iya honi naminangula linga muteue vukalu vua Njambi vuje vuli nakuija? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Nga mutonda kuteua kuvukalu vua Njambi lingeni viuma vije vimuesa ngeci munatenguluka ku vupi vueni. Keti mu lihandekese mu mitima yeni ngueni ‘Tuli na cisemi cetu Avilahama.’ Mua vusunga njimileka nguange Njambi asa kutengulula mavue aua naku uapuisa vatekulu va Avilahama! <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Ngimbu vanaihaka laja kumizi ya muti, muti uoshe kuuimi vushuka vua cili vaka uteta nakuumbila mu tuhia.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Vantu vamuihuile nguavo, “Kaha honi tulinga vati?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Ou hali na vikovelo vivali ahaneko cimo uje kesi naco, kaha nou alina via kulia ahaneko vakuavo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Vaka kutambula lisimo vezile linga avambuitike, kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Mulongisi, yetu tunapande kulinga vika?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Keti mukatambule kupulakana omo muvemika.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Masualale vamo naua vamuihuile nguavo, “Netu naua tunapande kulinga vika?” Kaha uavalekele nguendi, “Keti muka pukule viuma via vakueni, cipue kuvangela, simpeni na fueto yeni.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Vantu vakele nalikulahelo lia kuvandamena nguavo Kilistu eja honi, voshe vakele na kulihozola mu mutima yavo hali Iuano nguavo hamo ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Kaha Iuano uahandekele kuli voshe nguendi, “Njimimbuitika mu mema, vuno honi ouo akeja napu uakama kupulakana yange. Ku njapandele cipue kuzitula mikole ya ha vinkaku viendi. Ikeye akamimbuitika na Cimbembesi ca kulela na mu tuhia. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Lisehua lili mu livoko liendi, ikeye akapekula na kulelesa muacili vinona vioshe kulijunguilo liendi, kaha tiliku akaitulika mu cishete cendi, vuno honi mujungu uoshe akautsimika na tuhia tuakuhona kuzima!”<verse eid="LUK 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Ha kuvasindiya cikuma Iuano uambuluile Muzimbu ua Cili ku vantu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Naua Iuano uatenukilile muene Helonde, omo Helonde uambate Helondiya mpuevo ya munaina Filipu, kaha naua uamutenukilile omuo ualingile viuma vieka via vipi. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Cuma cacipi cikuma ca lingile naua Helonde ca kuhaka Iuano mu kamenga.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamumbuitika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateu3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mako1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Kaha omo Iuano uakele nakumbuitika vantu voshe na Yesu naua vamumbuitikile. Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu omo uakele na kulombela, lilu liashokolokele. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Kaha Cimbembesi ca kulela ca shulukile hali ikeye mucifua ca livembe. Kaha muilu mua humine lizi ngualio, “Yove munange injazema, njili na kuvuahelela hali yove.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vakukuluila va Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateu1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu uaputukile kuambulula na kulongesa kucivunga te hali na miaka makumi atatu. Kaha vantu vamu tantekeyele nguavo ikeye muna Yosefa. Yosefa uapuile muna Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Heli uapuile muna Matati, Matati uapuile muna Levi, Levi uapuile muna Meleki, Maleki uapuile muna Njanayi, Njanayi uapuile muna Yosefa, <verse eid="LUK 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yosefa uapuile muna Matiyasi, Matayasi uapuile muna Amose, Amose uapuile muna Nashumi, Nashumi uapuile muna Eseli, Eseli uapuile muna Nangai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nangai uapuile muna Maate, Maate uapuile muna Matatiya, Matatiya uapuile muna Semehine, Semehine uapuile muna Yoseke, Yoseke uapuile muna Yonda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yonda uapuile muna Youanane, Youanane uapuile muna Lehesa, Lehesa uapuile muna Zelumbambele, Zelumbambele uapuile muna Sheyaletiyele, Sheyaletiyele uapuile muna Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neli uapuile muna Meleki, Meleki uapuile muna Andi, Andi uapuile muna Kosame, Kosame uapuile muna Elemandame, Elemandame uapuile muna Ele, <verse eid="LUK 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Ele uapuile muna Yoshiua, Yoshiua uapuile muna Ezazale, Ezazale uapuile muna Yolime, Yolime uapuile muna Matata, Matata uapuile muna Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Levi uapuile muna Simioni, Simioni uapuile muna Yunda, Yunda uapuile muna Yosefa, Yosefa uapuile muna Njoname, Njoname uapuile muna Eliakime, <verse eid="LUK 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakime uapuile muna Meleya, Meleya uapuile muna Mena, Mena uapuile muna Matata, Matata uapuile muna Natane, Natane uapuile muna Ndaviti, <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Ndaviti uapuile muna Njesi, Njesi uapuile muna Ovende, Ovende uapuile muna Mbouasi, Mbouasi uapuile muna Salemone, Salemone uapuile muna Naheshoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nashone uapuile muna Aminandave, Aminandave uapuile muna Andemine, Andamine uapuile muna Aleni, Aleni uapuile muna Izeloni, Izeloni uapuile muna Peleze, Peleze uapuile muna Yunda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yunda uapuile muna Yakomba, Yakomba uapuile muna Isake, Iseke uapuile muna Avilahama, Avilahama uapuile muna Tela, Tela uapuile muna Nahole, <verse eid="LUK 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahole ua puile muna Selunge, Selunge uapuile muna Leu, Leu uapuile muna Pelenge, Pelenge uapuile muna Hevele, Hevele uapuile muna shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Shela uapuile muna Kainane, Kainane uapuile muna Alepakeshande, Alepakeshande uapuile muna Shemi, Shemi uapuile muna Noua, Noua uapuile muna Lameki <verse eid="LUK 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lameki uapuile muna Matusela, Matusela uapuile muna Enoki, uapuile muna Njalende, Njalende uapuile muna Maalalele, Maalalele uapuile muna Kenane <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenane uapuile muna Enoshe, Enoshe uapuile muna Sete, Sete uapuile muna Andama, Andama uapuile muna Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu va mueseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateu4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mako1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Yesu hakushula na Cimbembesi ca kulela, uahumine ku Ndonga ya Yundau, kaha Cimbembesi camutuamenenene mu mpambo, <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>kuje Satana uakamuesekele matangua makumi auana. Ha ntsimbu ije yoshe Yesu kalile nacimo cahi, omo matangua aje ahuile, kaha uovuile njala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Kaha Satana uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi shika livue eli linga lilihimpule mbolo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanavisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Muntu kasa kuyoya na mbolo lika kuahi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Kaha Satana ualondesele Yesu helu lia munkinda ualaha, kaha uamumuesele muka ntsimbu kakandende vumuene vuoshe vuahano ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Kaha Satana uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikakuhana vumuene ovu na vufuko vuoshe vilimo, omuo vanjihanavio, kaha njikavihana kuli uoshe uje injitonda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>Nga unjilemesa, kaha vioshe evi vikapua viove.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vanavisoneka mu Visoneke nguavo, ‘Ukalemesa Muene Njambi yove, ikeye lika iukapangela!’”<verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Kaha Satana uamutualele ku Yelusalema, uamuhakele ha kashongua ka njivo ya Muene Njambi, uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga u Muna Njambi, liumbile ha mavu kuhuma kuno kuilu, <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>omuo vanavisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Njambi akashika tungelo vendi na kukuniunga.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>Kaha vanavisoneka mu Visoneka naua nguavo, ‘Vakakukuata, linga viliato viove keti vikatsutsuke ku livue.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vanavisoneka mu Visoneka nguavo, ‘Keti ueseke Muene Njambi yove.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Omo Satana uamanesele kueseka Yesu mu vingila vioshe, kaha uamusezele noho hakauana ntsimbu ikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aputuka vipangi viendi mu Ngalileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateu4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mako1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Kaha Yesu uahilukile ku Ngalileya, na nzili ya Cimbembesi ca kulela yakele muli ikeye. Kaha muzimbu uendi uatsimanene mu nganda yoshe ya Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Yesu uavalongesele mu vinjivo viavo via malombelo, kaha voshe vamushangazalele.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamuviana mu Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mako6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yesu uaile ku Nazaleta, kuje kuakolelele, kaha uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo ha litangua lia Sapalalo ngue ku cilika cendi. Kaha uemanene na kutanda Visoneka. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Vamuhanene livulu lia sonekele Isaya Kananguizi ua Njambi. Kaha uazengunuine lije livulu liakuzenga, uauanene ha mutambela uje uatondele kutanda. Kaha uatandele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>“Cimbembesi ca Muene Njambi cili muli yange, omuo nanjihangula kuambulula Muzimbu ua Cili kuli vihutu. Nanjitumu kuambulula linga vinzinda vaka vapatule, nakuambulula linga tupuputua vakamone, nakunjituma kupatula vaje vavali nakuyandesa, <verse eid="LUK 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>nakunjituma kuambulula ngeci ntsimbu inahete ya kavumbi ka Muene Njambi ku vantu vendi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Yesu uazengele lije livulu, ualihanene naua kuli muka kuniunga, kaha uatumamene. Vantu voshe vakele muje mu njivo ya malombelo vamutalele ntooma, <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Visoneka evi lelo vinapuisamo ku mesho eni, ngue omo munovu vanakele nakulitanda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Kaha voshe vamushangazalele, valikomokelele ku mezi endi acili aje ahandekele, vahandekele nguavo, “Ou ikeye uje muna Yosefa ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Mua vusunga mukanjitela cisimo eci ngueni, ‘Ove cimbanda likanguise yove vavenia!’ Cimukalumbununa cikapua ngueni, ‘Yove linga viuma vioshe muno muimbo liove, vijevene vituovuile viualingile mu Capenama.’ <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>Mua vusunga njimileka, naumo uahi kananguizi ua Njambi ivakatava muimbo liendi. <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/>Vuno honi muavusunga njimileka mu lifuti lietu lia Isaleli muakele vantuluue vavengi ha matangua a Eliya kananguizi ua Njambi, omo kalunga kanokele miaka itatu na vingonde vitanu na imo naua honi kuakele njala mu lifuti lioshe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/>Eliya kuvamutumine kuli voshe, vuno honi kuli ntuluue uje keti Kayunda uje uakele mu limbo lia Zelefani kuyehi na mbonge ya Sindone. <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/>Kuakele vantu vavengi vakele nakuvavala mbumba mu Isaleli ha ntsimbu ya Elisha kananguizi ua Njambi, vuno honi naumo uahi yakanguisile kuvanga lika Namane keti Kayunda uaku Silia.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Omo vantu vaje vakele mu njivo ya malombelo vazivile evi, vakele na litoto. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Vakatukile, kaha vakokelele Yesu hambaza ya nganda, vamutualele kuntsongo ya munkinda haje ha vatungile nganda yavo. Vatondele ngeci vakamumbile mu cimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Kaha uahitile mukati kavo nakuya.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yala muka Cimbembesi ca kujuala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mako1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Yesu uaile ku Kapenama, mbonge ya mu Ngalileya, kuje uakalongesele vantu lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Vantu voshe vakomokele cikuma kuambulula nguendi, omuo mezi endi akele na nzili. <verse eid="LUK 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Kaha mu njivo ya malombelo muakele yala umo uakele na Cimbembesi ca kujuala, catambekele cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Haa! Yove Yesu uaku Nazaleta utonda kulinga vika kuno netu? Uneja nakutunongesa ndi? Nja kutantekeya yove uapua umo Uakulela ua Njambi!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Kaha honi Yesu uashikile Cimbembesi ca kujuala nguendi, “Kuluu huma muli muntu ou!” Kaha cije Cimbembesi ca kujuala cauisilile uje yala ha mavu ku mesho avo voshe, kaha ca humine muli ikeye kuakuhona kumuvetuesa. <verse eid="LUK 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Vantu voshe valikomokelele cikuma vaputukile kulihandekesa umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Majui muka aua? Muntu ou hali na nzili ya kushika vimbembesi via kujuala kaha vimuivuila.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Kaha vialingile vioshe viovuikile mu cihela ca lifuti lije.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Akanguisa vantu vavengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mako1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Kaha Yesu uahumine mu njivo ya malombelo uaile ku njivo ya Simoni. Uauanene vainamueno ya Simoni vavavala lisika sika liakama cikuma. Valombele Yesu linga amukangule. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Kaha Yesu uaile kuli ikeye nakumukotamena, kaha uashikile lije lisika sika kuhua kaha uakangukile na kuimana nakuputuka kuvapangela via kulia. <verse eid="LUK 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Hakulahuka kua litangua, voshe vaje vakele na mishongo yakuli sezaseza vavanehele kuli Yesu, voshe uavahakele mavoko na kuvakanguisa. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Kaha vimbembesi via kujuala naua via huminemo mu vantu vavengi na kutambeka nguavio, “Yove u Muna Njambi!” Vuno honi ikeye uashikile vimbembesi via kujuala ngeci keti vihandeka nacimo cahi naua, omuo vikevio viamutantekeyele nguavio ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ambulula mu Vinjivo via Malombelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mako1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Omo kuacele Yesu uatuhukile, nakuya kuali kaliendi lika. Vantu vaputukile kumutondezeka, omo vamuuanene vatondele kumuvindika ngeci keti ahume kuli vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njapande kuambulula Muzimbu Viacili via vumuene vua Njambi mu vimbonge vieka naua, omuo evi vikevo via njitumine kulinga Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Uakele na kuambulula mu vinjivo via malombelo via Njambi vioshe viamu Yundeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana Vandongisi va kulivanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateu4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mako1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Litangua limo Yesu uemanene ha ntunda ya cisali ca Ngenesaleta te vantu vakele nakulisindika kuya kuli ikeye linga vovue lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Kaha uamuene mato avali vanaatutika ku mukulo ua cisali. Vaka kuta vatsi vahumine mu mato na kukusha manda avo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu uakovelele mu vuato vumo, vuakele vua Simoni, kaha uamulombele ngeci avusindikile alahako kamandende na hantunda. Yesu uatumamene mu vuato, kaha ualongesele cije civunga. <verse eid="LUK 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Omo Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka, kaha uahandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Sindikila vuato haje ha mema a kulova, kaha yove na vakueni teni manda eni linga mujevele vantsi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simoni uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, tunapanga cikuma vutsiki vuoshe vuno honi nakamo tunakuata kahi. Vuno honi omuo ukahandeka ngoco, kaha tuta manda.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Kaha omo vate manda vakuate vatsi vavengi cikuma, kaha manda aputukile kutavuka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Nankuma, vaniatele vavusamba vavo vakele mu vuato vukuavo veje vaku vakuase. Vezile vashulisile mato oshe na vatsi mukemo vaputukile kuvombela. <verse eid="LUK 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Omo Simoni Petulu uamuene vije vialingiuile, uatsikamene ha mavuli ku mesho a Yesu na kuhandeka nguendi, “Muene, huma kuli yange, omuo yange njimuka vupi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Simoni na vakuavo vali komokelele cikuma ha kumona vatsi vavengi vava kuatele. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Simoni uakele navavusamba vendi vavali mazina avo apuile Yakomba na Iuano vana va Zembendeo, nava kevo naua vali komokele cikuma. Yesu uahandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Keti uzive liova, hume hano ukata vantu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Vatutikile mato avo ku ntunda, vasezele vioshe, kaha vakavele Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa muka mbumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mako1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Litangua limo Yesu uakele mu mbonge imo muje muakele yala umo uakele nakuyanda na mushongo ua mbumba. Omo uamuene Yesu, uauile nacihanga cendi ha mavu amulambelelele nguendi, “Muene, nga utonda, uasa kunjikanguisa!” <verse eid="LUK 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Yesu uoluele livoko liendi uamukuate uahandekele nguendi, “Njitonda, kanguka!” Hajevene uakangukile. <verse eid="LUK 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu uamushikile nguendi, “Keti ulekeko muntu umo cuma eci kuahi, vuno honi ya ukalisholole kuli kasasendote linga vantu voshe vatantekeye nguavo vakukangula, ambahoni ukakombelele nkombelo ije yashikile Mosesa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Vuno honi muzimbu uahali Yesu uakele nakushanduokela kuoshe, kaha vivunga via vantu vezile nakumuivuilila na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Vuno honi Yesu kakengi uakele nakuvaseza nakuya kuali kaliendi lika na kulombela.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa muka kalepa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mako2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakulongesa, Vafaliseo vamo na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vatumamene kuje, vahumine mu membo a ku Ngalileya na ku Yundeya na ku mbonge yakama ya Yelusalema. Nzili ya Muene Njambi yakele hali Yesu mukukanguisa vantu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Kaha vamala vamo vanehele yala muka kalepa vamulangeka ha citalatala, vesekele kumukovelesa mu njivo linga vamulangeke ku lutue lua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Omuo civunga ca vantu, kuvauanene ngila yaku mukovelesela mukati. Nankuma, vamutualele helu lia njivo, vatuvile mbengua mu mateya, kaha vamusoselele na citalatala cendi ha mavu mukati ka civunga kulutue lua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Omo Yesu uavamuene lutsilielo luavo, uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Kavusamba kange, vipi viove vana visambesa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseo vaputukile kusinganieka nguavo, “Iya ou yala alinakushaula Njambi? Njambi lika ikeye muka kusambuesa vupi!” <verse eid="LUK 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Yesu uazivukile viyongola viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vikahoni mulina kuyonguela viuma via ngacije? <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Cacasi cika, kuhandeka nguange, ‘Vipi viove vana visambesa,’ indi kuhandeka nguange, ‘Katuka uende’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/>Njimimuesa linga mutantekeye ngueni Muna Muntu hali na nzili hano ha mavu ya kusambuesa vipi.” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje muka kakalepa nguendi, “Njikuleka nguange katuka, ambata citalatala cove, uye ku njivo yove!” <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Kaha hajevene uakatukile hhakati kavo, uambate citalatala cendi uaile ku njivo nakushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Kaha voshe valikomokelele cikuma! Vovuile liova, vashangazalele Njambi vahandekele nguavo, “Lelo tunamono viuma via kukomokesa!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asana Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mako2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Munima yevi, Yesu uatuhukile, kaha uamuene muka kutambula lisimu, lizina liendi Levi, natumama mu njivo yendi ya kutambuila lisimu. Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Njikave.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Kaha Levi uakatukile, uasezele vioshe na kumukava. <verse eid="LUK 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Kaha Levi calingiuile Yesu ciuano cakama cakulia mu njivo yendi, kaha hhakati kavaje vavalaniene hakele vaka kutambula lisimu na vantu veka vavengi. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Vafaliseo vamo na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vaje vakundamene ku mpunga yavo valiniengelele kuli vandongisi va Yesu. Vehuile nguavo, “Vikahoni mulia na kunua hamo na vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vakangule kuvekutonda cimbanda kuahi, kuvanga vaka kuvavala lika. <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/>Ngoco vene yange kunjezile mukusana vantu vaje vanalimono vakevo vavenia nguavo vaka vusunga linga vatenguluke, vuno honi vantu vaje vaka vupi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula caha kulikela kulia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mako2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Vantu vamo vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Vandongisi va Iuano vakalikela kulia vintsimbu viavingi na kulombela, na vandongisi va Vafaliseo naua vakalingi cuma cimo, vuno honi vandongisi vove vakali na kunua ntsimbu yoshe.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma yeni mutalelela vangenzi ku ciuano ca vulo linga vaye na njala ndi? Muavusunga vene kuahi! Omo vavenia vulo acili navo kuvapandele kulinga ngacije. <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/>Vuno honi litangua likeja omo vakahumisa vavenia vulo hhakati kavo, ambahoni vakalikela kulia.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Yesu uavatelele naua cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuuasa kutavula cikamba ku kazaku kakaha na kucitongela ha kazaku ka laja. Nga ulingamo, kaha utavula kazaku kakaha, cikamba caciha kucilitombola na ntanga yalaja. <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/>Naua vene kuvekulongela viniu viavihia mu vinjeke via vilambu vialaja. Nga ulingamo vije vinjeke via vilambu vitavuka kaha viniu vihitikila muangoco. <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/>Vuno honi viniu viavihia vaka vilongela mu vinjeke via vilambu viavihia. <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/>Kuuasa kunua viniu viavihia omo unanu laja viniu vialaja. Uhandeka nguove, ‘Viniu vialaja viacili.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikeye Muene ua Litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mako2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakele nakuhita mu mehia a tiliku. Vandongisi vendi vaputukile kushututozola mitue ya tiliku, vaitsenene mu mavoko avo, kaha valile vinona. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Kaha Vafaliseo vamo vakele kuje vavehuile nguavo, “Omo vika mulinakulingila evi kuvekulinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo kuya mu Lishiko lia Mosesa?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma kanda mutande vije vialingile Ndaviti na vaje vakele hamo nendi omo vazivile njala ndi? <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/>Uakovelele mu njivo ya Muene Njambi, kasasendote uamuhanene lisesa lia kunona ije mbolo ivakombelele kuli Njambi, ualile, na kuhanako naua vantu vendi. Mbolo ije kuyapandele ku ilia kuli muntu uoshe kuvanga tusasendote lika.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Kaha Yesu uamanesele nguendi, “Muna Muntu ikeye Muene ua Litangua lia Sapalalo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala uakusekua livoko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mako3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Ha litangua lia Sapalalo likuavo Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo, kaha ualongesele. Muakele yala umo uakusekua livoko lia cilio. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Kaha valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseo vamo vatondele kashuilo hali Yesu linga vamu uaneneho mulonga, nankuma, vamutalele ntoma muyehi yehi linga vamone nga ikeye akanguisa uje muntu ha litangua lia Sapalalo. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Vuno honi Yesu uazivukile viyongola viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala uakusekua livoko nguendi, “Katuka uije hano hhakati.” Kaha uje yala uakatukile uemanene mukati. <verse eid="LUK 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Nankuma, Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njimihula nguange, cuma muka vanatutavesa ha Lishiko lietu kucilinga ha litangua lia Sapalalo? Kupanga viacili indi kupanga viavipi? Kuamena muono ua muntu indi kuunongesa?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Uatalele kuli vakevo voshe noku noku, kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Olola livoko liove.” Uoluele livoko liendi, kaha liakangukile.<verse eid="LUK 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Ha cuma eci valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseo vakele na matoto, kaha valihandekesele hhakati kavo vivapandele kulinga kuli Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahangula tunganda likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mako3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ha ntsimbu ije Yesu ualondele ku munkinda na kulombela, kaha uakele nakulombela vutsiki vuoshe kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Omo litangua liatuhukile, kaha uasanene vandongisi vendi linga veje kuli ikeye, kaha uahanguileho likumi na vavali hhakati kavo, vaje vatumbuile tunganda. <verse eid="LUK 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Aua akeuo mazina avo: Simoni uje yalukile Petulu na munaina Anduleo, Yakomba na Iuano, Filipu na Mbatolomeo, <verse eid="LUK 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mateu na Tomasi, Yakomba muna Alufeya, na Simoni (uje ivatumbuile “Zelote.”) <verse eid="LUK 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yundasa muna Yakomba, na Yundasa Sakaliote uje uamuendele vungungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alongesa na Kukanguisa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateu4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu na vandongisi vendi vahumine ku munkinda kaha vemanene ku mutambela uaku jalamanena. Na civunga ceka cakama ca vandongisi vakele kuje nakumuvandamena. Naua civunga cakama ca vantu cahumine ku Yundeya kuoshe na ku Yelusalema, naku vimbonge via ku cikuma ca Tile na ku Sindone. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Vezile nakumuvuilila na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. Voshe vaje vakele nakuyanda na vimbembesi via kujuala vezile, kaha uavakanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu vesekele kumukambeka mavoko, omuo nzili yahumine kuli ikeye na kuvakanguisa voshe.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo na Vinangulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateu5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Yesu uatalele vandongisi vendi, kaha uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Muavezika yeni vaka kuhutua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">omuo Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu vueni!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>“Muavezika yeni muli na njala vuavuno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">omuo mukakuta!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">“Muavezika yeni mulinakulila vuavuno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">omuo mukajolelela!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>“Muavezika omuo vantu vamizinda na kumiviana na kumishaula na kumitumbula nguavo muva vapi, vioshe evi omuo mukavangeya Muna Muntu!” <verse eid="LUK 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>Joleleni omo eci cilingiua, kineni na kujolela, omuo Njambi namivuahesela cikandelela ceni cakama muilu. Omuo vakuluntu vavo valingile ngacije kuli tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>“Vuno honi tuyando kuli yeni munafuku laja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">omuo muatambula laja kuyoya kuacili!”<verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>“Tuyando tueni yeni munakuta vuavuno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">omuo mukaziva njala!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Tuyando tueni yeni muli nakujolela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">omuo muka pihilila na kulila!<verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>“Tuyando tueni omuo vantu voshe vali nakumishangazala, omuo vakuluntu vavo valingile ngacije kuli tunanguizi va Njambi va makuli.<verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zangeni vitozi veni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateu5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12a">7:12a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>“Vuno honi njimileka yeni vaka kunjitolilila nguange, zangeni vitozi veni, lingeni muacili kuli vaje vamizinda, <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/>vezikiseni vaje vamisinga, kaha lombeleleni vaje vali nakumiyandesa. <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/>Nga muntu akupupa ku litama limo, kaha mutenguluile akupupe ku litama likuavo naua, nga muntu akunieka kazaku kove, muhane naua na cikovelo cove. <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/>Muntu uje amilomba muhaneni cuma cije canamilombo, omo muntu ambata cuma cove, kaha keti ucihule naua. <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/>Viuma vioshe vimutonda ngeci vakueni vamilingilevio, mukemuo vene, neni naua valingilenavio.<verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>“Nga muzanga lika vaje vamizanga, vikahoni mutambuila vishangalo? Cipue vaka vipi vakazanga vaka kuvazanga! <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/>Nga mulinga lika muacili kuli vaje vakamilingi muacili, vikahoni mutambuila vishangalo? Cipue vaka vupi mukemuo muvakalingi! <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/>Nga mukumuisa lika vaje muavandamena ngueni vamihiluisila, vikahoni mutambuila vishangalo? Cipue vaka vupi naua vakalikumuisa, linga vatambule ngue muje muvanahana. <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/>Vuno honi zangeni vitozi veni, kaha lingeni muacili kuli vakevo, vakumuiseni vuno honi keti muvandamene ngueni mukavitambula naua. Kaha cikandelela ceni cikapua cakama, mukapua vana va Njambi ua Helu lia Helu. Omuo ikeye akevuila ngozi vaje kuvekumukandelela na vaje vaka vupi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/>Pueni vaka cikeketima ngue Ishueni uapua muka cikeketima.<verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhisa Vakueni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateu7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>“Keti muhise, kuteua neni vakamihisa, keti mupaye, kuteua neni vakamipaya, sambeseni, kaha neni vakamisambesa. <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/>Haneni, kaha neni vakamihana. Cikapua nge muka kulandesa uje akuhana seteko ya vinona, akaizindangeya nakui niekumuna kaha akashulilisaho cikuma noho ishulisa muvimbango via cisetekelo na kumuanianga kaha honi akakuhanavio vioshe. Seteko ije museteka nayo vakueni, ikeyo naua vakamiseteka nayo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Kapuputua umo kasa kutuamenena kapuputua mukuavo, nga alingamo voshe vavali vakauila mucina. <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/>Kukuesi ndongisi atuvakana mulongisi uendi vuno honi ndongisi uoshe, omo namanesa kulilongesa cendi, ikeye naua akapua hamo na mulongisi uendi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>“Vikahoni umona kacishoni kali ha lisho lia mukueni, vuno honi ku uyongola mukambo uli mulisho liove? <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/>Vatihoni uhandeka na mukueni nguove, ‘Mukuetu, teua njikuhumise kacishoni kali ha lisho liove,’ omo yove uli na mukambo mu lisho liove? Ove muka civembulu! Ha kulivanga humisa mukambo uli mu lisho liove, kaha umone muacili hakuhumisa kacishoni kali ha lisho lia mukueni.<verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muti na Vushuka vuavo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateu7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>“Muti uacili kuuasa kuima vushuka vuavupi, cipue muti uaupi kuuasa kuima vushuka vuacili. <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/>Muti uoshe vauzivukila ku vushuka vuauo, omuo kuuasa kuhela vushuka vua mukuyu na mikolovozi ya viniu ku muti ua mambimbo. <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/>Muntu uacili ikeye muka kusholola viuma via viacili via ku mutima uendi, muntu ua mupi akasholola viuma viavipi via ku mutima uendi omuo kanua kakahandeka vije viashula mu mutima.<verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kutunga vinjivo Vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateu7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>“Vika munjitumbuila ngueni, ‘Muene, Muene’, vuno honi kumulingi vinjimileka? <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/>Njimileka cifua cendi uoshe uje eja kuli yange na kuvuilila mezi ange na kuuononoka. <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/>Napu ngue yala uakutungila njivo yendi, uahindile nakulovesa luvula ha livue. Livazi liezile liapupile kuje ku njivo, vuno honi kuyaningangele, omuo luvula luaije njivo luakele ha livue. <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/>Vuno honi uoshe aziva mezi ange kuakuhona kuuononoka napu ngue yala uatungile njivo yendi kuakuhona kuhinda luvula. Omo livazi liapupile kuje ku njivo, kaha yasiukile hajevene, kuua kuayo kuapuile kuakupi cikuma!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo lua Mukuluntu ua Loma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateu8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Omo Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka viuma vioshe evi ku vantu, kaha uaile ku Kapenama. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Mu mbonge ije muakele mukuluntu ua masualale va Loma uje uakele na ngamba yendi uaseho cikuma kuli ikeye. Uje muntu uavavalele uatondele kutsa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Omo uje mukuluntu uovuile lutsimo lua Yesu, uatumine vamo vakuluntu va Vayunda kuli ikeye nakumulomba eje mukukanguisa ngamba yendi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Vezile kuli Yesu vamulambelelele cikuma nguavo, “Ou yala napande kumukuasa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Ikeye uazanga vantu vetu, naua uatutungilile njivo ya malombelo yetu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesu uaile navo, vuno honi omo uahete kuyehi na njivo, uje mukuluntu ua masualale uatumine vavusamba vendi kuli Yesu nakumuleka nguavo, “Muene, keti ukaluuise mutima uove omuo kucanjipandele yove ukakovele mu njivo yange. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Ngecivene nange naua kucanjipandele kuheta kuli yove. Handeka lika lizi, kaha ngamba yange akakanguka. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Njitantekeye eci omuo nange njili muitsi lia nzili yakama, na masualale vali muitsi liange, njishika umo nguange, ‘Ya!’ kaha aya, kaha naua njishika mukuavo nguange, ‘Ija!’ kaha eja. Njihandeka kuli ngamba yange nguange, ‘Linga evi!’ kaha acilinga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu ualikomokelele omo uovuile evi, kaha uatengulukilile kuli cije civunga camukavele, uahandekele nguendi, “Njimileka nguange, nakumo kuahi kunjinauana lutsilieloliakama ngue eli, cipue mu Isaleli luahimo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Omo vaje vamala vavatumine vahilukile ku njivo ya uje mukuluntu vaka uanene uje ngamba nakanguka.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu asangula muna ntuluue ua yala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Munima yevi Yesu uaile ku mbonge ya Naine, vandongisi vendi na civunga cakama vamukavele. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Omo ikeye uahete kuyehi na cikolo ca mbonge, kaha vantu vatuhuile civimbi ha mbanza, uje yala uatsile uapuile muana umolika uaumo ntuluue, kaha civunga cakama cahumine muje mu limbo cakele hamo nauje ntuluue. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Omo Muene Yesu uamumuene, kaha uamuivuilile cikeketima, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti ulile.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Ambahoni Yesu uaile uakakuate ku citala tala, kaha vaje tufunde vemanene. Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Ove kankalava, njikuleka nguange, hinduka!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Kaha uje yala uatsile uasangukile uatumamene na kuputuka kuhandeka, kaha Yesu uamuhanene kuli vaina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Vantu voshe vovuile liova, kaha vashangazalele Njambi, vahandekele nguavo, “Kananguizi ua Njambi uakama neja kuli yetu na Njambi neja nakuovola vantu vendi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Kaha lutsimo olu lua Yesu luashandokelele mu Yundeya muoshe na ku vinganda vioshe via kulihata.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iuano muka kumbuitika atuma vantu vavali kuli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateu11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Omo vandongisi va Iuano vamulekele viuma vioshe evi, kaha uasaneneko vandongisi vendi vavali. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Uavatumine kuli Muene Yesu nakumuihula nguavo, “Yove vene uija? Indi tuvandameneko ueka naua.”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Omo vamala vezile kuli Yesu vahandekele nguavo, “Iuano muka kumbuitika natutumu kuli yove nakuihula nga yove uje eja indi tucivandameneko ueka naua.”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu uakanguisile vantu vavengi ku kuvavala kuavo, naku mishongo yavo nakuhumisa mahamba na kumuesa tupuputua vavengi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Kaha uatavele vandongisi va Iuano nguendi, “Yemuye mukahandeke kuli Iuano vimunamono nevi vimunevu. Tupuputua vamona, vilema venda, vaka mbumba vanalele, tusinda matuitui vaziva, vatsi vasanguka, kaha muzimbu uacili vauambulula kuli tuhutu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/>Vanavezika vaje kuvakecela lutsilielo luavo muli yange.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Omo vandongisi va Iuano vahilukile, kaha Yesu ualekele cije civunga hali Iuano nguendi, “Omo muaile kuli Iuano mu mpambo muatondele kukamona muntu ua vati? Indi muaile mukumona yala uakufua ngue vishoni via laha viakutepuzoka na mpunzi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/>Muaile nakumona vika honi? Muntu nazala vuzalo vuasenga ndi? Vantu vakakuzala muacili na kukala muasenga vakakala mu mihela ya muene. <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/>Njilekeni muatondele kukamona vikahoni? Muatondele kukamona kananguizi ua Njambi ndi? Eyo, ikeye vene naua ikeye kananguizi ua Njambi uakama. <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/>Ou ikeye Iuano uje visoneka vihandeka nguavio, ‘Njikatuma kanganda kange kulutue luove. Akavuahesa ngila yove.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>Njimileka nguange, ku vantu voshe vaje vanakeleko, naumo uahi napulaka Iuano. Vuno honi uje uamundende kumaneselela mu vumuene vua Njambi ikeye napulakana Iuano.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Vantu voshe hamo na vaka kutambula lisimo vononokele vusunga vua Njambi, kaha vavambuitikile kuli Iuano. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Vuno honi Vafaliseo na valongisi va Mashiko a Mosesa vavianene vilinga via Njambi hali vakevo, mukemo kuva vambuitikile kuli Iuano.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuliveya njasa kusetekesa vantu va matangua ano? Vanapu ngue vika? <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/>Vakevo vanapu ngue vanike vanatumama kumuhela uakulandesela viuma, kaha valitambakana umo na mukuavo, ‘Tunamimbilile miaso ya vushombolua, vuno honi kumuakinine! Tuamimbilile miaso ya vusiua vuno honi kumua lilile!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>Omo Iuano muka kumbuitika uezile, kalile mbolo cipue kunua viniu, kaha muahandekele ngueni, ‘Ali na mahamba!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/>Kaha omo Muna Muntu uezile, ikeye ualile nakunua, kaha muahandekele ngueni, ‘Taleni ou yala! Uapua mukamutupu na kupenda, kaha kavusamba ua vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/>Ngoco vene mana vana amuesa kupua acili kuvuyoye vua vaje vauakava.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mpuevo ua vupi va musambesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Litangua limo umo ua Vafaliseo ualizanga lia Simon ualaniene Yesu kulia nendi, kaha uakovelele mu njivo Yakafaliseo nakutumama ku mesa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Kuakele mpuevo ua mu mbonge ije, uapuile muka vupi. Omo uovuile nguendi Yesu hali na kulia mu njivo ya Kafaliseo, uanehele kantsazi kacili ka mazi aluengo luacili. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Kaha uemanene kunima ya viliato via Yesu, na kulila kaha uaputukile kujulisa viliato via Yesu na misozi yendi, kaha uavihundile navi nkambu viendi naku tsuemba ku viliato viendi, kaha uamuitilile mazi kumikono. <verse eid="LUK 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Omo Kafaliseo uje uamusanene uamuene eci, uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Nga ou yala uapuile kananguizi, nge natantekeya nacifua muka cou mpuevo na mukuata. Nge natantekeya nguendi uapua muka vupi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu uamulekele nguendi, “njili na cuma cimo njitonda kukuleka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Kaha uatavele nguendi, “Cikahoni Mulongisi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu uamutililile nguendi, “Kuakele vamala vavali vakumuine vimbongo kuli muka kukumuisa. Umo uakumuine vimbongo via Siliva viakupua vihita vitanu, mukuavo naua uakumuine vimbongo via Siliva makumi atanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/>Omo vahonouele kuvihiluisa, uava konekelele voshe vavali. Hakati kavo iya uje akamuzanga cikuma?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simoni uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njasinganieka nguange uje yakonekelele cikuma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Una yulu muacili.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Tala ou mpuevo, kaha lisikanieke yove vavenia. Kaha uatengulukilile kuli mpuevo na kuhandekele kuli Simoni nguendi, “Uamumono ou mpuevo? Njakovelele mu njivo yove, kuuanjihanene mema akutana ku viliato viange, vuno honi najulisa viliato viange na misozi yendi na kunjihunda na vinkambu viendi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/>Unahonouele cipue kunjitsuemba, vuno honi kuhuma ntsimbu njakovelele muno mu njivo yove kecelele kutsuemba viliato viange. <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/>Kuuanjitambuile mukunjitila mazi ku mutue uange, vuno honi ikeye nanjitila mazi aluengo kuviliato viange. <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/>Njimileka, vanamukonekela vupi vuavuingi mukemo uakala nacizangango cikuma, vuno honi uje vanakonekela muvundende, uazanga via vindende.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli uje mpuevo nguendi, “Vipi vuove vana vanavikonekela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Kaha vaje vakele nendi ku mesa vaputukile kusinganieka nguavo, “Iya ou, asa kukonekela vipi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli mpuevo nguendi, “Lutsilielo luove lua kusambuesa. Ya mu ciyulo.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Hanima yevi, Yesu uakele nakuendangana mu vimbonge na mu membo, nakuambulula muzimbu uacili ua vumuene vua Njambi. Vavandongisi vendi likumi na vavali vaile hamo <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Navampuevo vamo vaile hamo nendi. Yesu uahumisile mahamba muli vakevo na kuvakanguisa ku mishongo yavo. Umo uavo uapuile Maliya mangandalena muli ikeye uahumisile mahamba atanu na avali. <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>Mukuavo uapuile Njuana mpuevo ya Kuza, mukuluntu uakulama vitenga via mu njivo ya Helonde, Mukuavo uapuile Susana na vakuavo vavengi. Ava vampuevo vakele nakukuasa Yesu na vandongisi vendi navukuasi vua vimbongo viavo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Muka Kukuva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mako4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Litangua limo vantu vavengi vezile nakukunguluka amo. Vahumine kuvi mbonge via vingi via kuli sezaseza kua kuivuilila Yesu. Uavatelele cisimo eci: <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/>Muka kulima uaile na kukuna vimbuto viendi. Omo uakele nakukuna vimbuto viendi, imo yauililile kumukulo ua ngila kaha vantu valiatangeleleho na tuzila vailile. <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/>Imo yauililile ha mavue kaha omo yamenene, yomine omuo kuya uanene mema. <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/>Imo ya vimbuto yauililile ha mingonga, ha kukola kuayo vaituvile ku mingonga. <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/>Vikuavo vimbuto via uililile ha mavu a vuilo, mbuto imo lika ya tuihuile cihita cavimbuto. Kaha Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka nguendi, “Uje uoshe hali na matuitui, azive!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua Visimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateu13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mako4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Vandongisi va Yesu Kilistu vamuihuile nguavo, Yesu, eci cisimo cilumbununa vika? <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>Uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Njambi namihangula linga mutantekeye vushueka vua vumuene vuendi, vuno honi kuli vamo njihandeka mu visimo linga, ‘Cipue vamona, vuno honi kuvamonesesa, cipue vovua vuno honi kuvovuisisa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alumbununa cisimo ca muka Kukuva</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mako4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>“Eci cikeco cilumbununa ca cisimo: mbuto ikeyo lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/>Vimbuto vije via uililile kumukulo ua ngila vili ngue vantu vevua lizi lia Njambi. Kaha satana eja na kuambata lizi mu mitima yavo, linga keti vakulahele na kuyoyesiua. <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/>Vimbuto viauililile ha mavu a mavue vinapu ngue vantu vaje vatambula lizi nakuvuahelelela omo valivua, vuno honi kuvesi na mizi. Ha ntsimbu ya vieseko vahilukila munima. <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/>Vimbuto viauililile ha mingonga vinapu ngue vantu vaje vevua lizi lia Njambi, vuno honi kulinienga, vufuko na senga via vuyoye via vatuvile. Kaha kuviakolele na kuima vushuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/>Vuno honi vimbuto vije via uililile ha mavu acili vinapu ngue vantu vacili vaje vali na mitima yacili, vovua lizi lia Njambi na kuliniunga na kukolesa ngo noho vema vushuka.<verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndeya ya muintsi lia Liendeko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mako4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>“Naumo uahi a shuameka ndeya na kuishueka muintsi lia liendeko cipue kuyaka muintsi lia muhela. Vuno honi vaihaka helu lia citumbiko linga uoshe akovela amone ceke. <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/>Vioshe vije vanashueke hano vikajomboloka na vioshe vije via kushueka hano vakavitantekeya, na kuvineha ha ceke. <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/>Mukemo muapande kuivuilila muacili kuvilongesa viange. Vaje vali navimo vakatambula viavingi vuno honi voshe kuvesi nacimo vakavanieka cipue vije viavindende vivasinganieka nguavo valinavio.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaina ya Yesu na Vamuanaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mako3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Kaha vaina ya Yesu na vamuanaye vezile kuli ikeye na kumumona, vuno honi vahonouele kushuena kuli ikeye omuo ya vantu vuingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Umo ua vantu vaje vakele kuje uamulekele nguendi, “Vanoko na vamuanoko vanemana hambanza, vatonda ku kumona.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vanana na vamuanetu vaje vaziva mezi a Njambi na kuakavangeya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aholuesa Linkimba liakama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mako4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Litangua limo Yesu uakovelele mu vuato na vandongisi vendi kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Tuyeni musinia lia cisali.” Kaha vaputukile kuya. <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Omo vakele nakujavuka Yesu uaile mutulo. Linkimba liaputukile mu cisali, ngeci na vuato vuaputukile kushula na mema, kaha vakele muvukalu. <verse eid="LUK 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Vandongisi vaile nakumuhindula, nguavo, “Muene, Muene, tuli nakunonga!” Uahindukile kaha uashikile mpunzi na mankimba, kaha vioshe vialikelele na kuholoka. <verse eid="LUK 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Uavehuile nguendi, “Lutsilielo lueni luli kuli?” Mu liova na mukukomoka valihuezele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Iya ou? Ashika mpunzi na mema, kaha vimuononoka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua Lihamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mako5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu na vandongisi viendi vajavukilile ku cihela kuje vantu va Ngalasene vakele nakuyoya, cije cakele musinia lia cisali kuhuma ku Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Omo Yesu uahete ha ntunda, uali uanene na yala uje uakele na lihamba uamuje mbonge. Ntsimbu yailaha ou yala kakele nakuzala vuzalo cipue kukala hembo, vuno honi uakele nakukala lika ku vihilo. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Omo uamuene Yesu ualilile cikuma na kuuila ku mikono yendi, kaha uatambakanene nguendi, “Utonda kulinga vika kuli yange, Yesu Muna Njambi Uakuhiana? Njikulomba keti unjiyandese!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Uje yala uahandekele evi omuo Yesu uahandekele kuli lije lihamba linga lihume muli uje yala. Vintsimbu viavingi viakele nakumuyandesa. Vantu vakele na kumukuta na malienge ku mavoko na ku mikono naku muniunga, vuno honi uakele nakuvatula kaha lihamba liakele nakumutuala mu musenge. <verse eid="LUK 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu uamuihuile nguendi, “Lizina liove yove iya?” Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Tuvavengi,” omuo mahamba vavengi vakovelele muli ikeye. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Kaha mahamba vamulombele kushuakumo nguavo keti avatuale mu cina ca kuhona cimbaluila. <verse eid="LUK 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Kuakele vangulu vavengi vakele na kulia kumukulo ua munkinda. Kaha mahamba valombele Yesu nguavio vika kovele muli vaje vangulu, kaha uavitavesele. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Omo mahamba ahumine muli uje yala, aile muli vaje vangulu, kaha vaje vangulu vahumine ha munkinda vashatukilile mu cisali na kunonga. <verse eid="LUK 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Omo vaje vaka kuniunga vangulu vamuene vije vialingiuile, vashatukile naku kambulula mu mbonge na mu membo akulihata. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Kaha vantu vaile na kumona ovio vialingiuile. Omo vahete kuli Yesu, vamuene uje yala yahumisile mahamba natumama ku viliato via Yesu, nazala na visinganieka viendi viakele muacili, kaha vateuele. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Vaje va vimuene valekele vantu muje uje yala uakele na mahamba muamu kanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Kaha vantu voshe vamu mbonge ya Ngalasa na vakumihela yakulihata valombele Yesu nguavo, ahume kuli vakevo omuo vateuele cikuma. Kaha Yesu uakovelele mu vuato na kulivuahesela linga aye. <verse eid="LUK 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Uje yala ya humisile mahamba ualombele Yesu nguendi, “Njikukave!” Vuno honi Yesu uavianene ua handekele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/>“Hiluka kuimbo ukavaleke viakama viana kulingila Njambi.” Kaha uje yala uaile na kuleka vantu mu mbonge vije Yesu namu lingilavio.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muna Njailusi ua mumbanda na mpuevo uje uakuate ku cikovelo ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mako5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Omo Yesu uahilukile ku Ngalileya, vantu vavengi vamutambuile, omuo voshe vakele naku muvandamena. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Kaha yala umo uezile kuli Yesu. Lizina liendi Njailusi mukuluntu ua njivo ya malombelo. Uauile ku viliato via Yesu na kumulomba nguendi, aye ku njivo yendi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>omuo munendi umo lika ua miaka likumi na ivali, uatondele kutsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu uaile hamo nendi. Omo vakele nakuya civunga ca vantu vakele nakusindakana Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Mu civunga cije vene muakele mpuevo uakele na mushongo uakuhita maninga ha miaka likumi na ivali vuno honi naumo uahi uamukanguisile. <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>Uezile munima ya Yesu kaha uakuate ku mukunduilo ua vuzalo vuendi, kaha hajevene kuhita maninga kuemanene. <verse eid="LUK 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu uehuile nguendi, “Iya nanjikuata?” Omo voshe vavianene Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Muene vantu va kuzengeleka kaha naua vakusindakana.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Umo nanjikuata, omuo njatantekeya nguange nzili yahumu muli Yange.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Kaha uje mpuevo ha kumona nge vanamutantekeya. Uezile nakujaja na kuuila ku viliato via Yesu. Kaha ku mesho a civunga ca vantu uahandekele omuo vika uakuatele Yesu nomu muana kangukila mu vuasi. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Munange, lutsilielo luove lua Kukuangisa. Ya na ciyulo.” <verse eid="LUK 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Tele Yesu uakele nakuhandeka, umo uezile kuhuma ku njivo ya Njailusi, Uahandekele nguendi, “Munove ua mpuevo natsi keti uyandese mulongisi naua.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Ha kuivua eci, Yesu uahandekele kuli Njailusi nguendi, “keti uzive liova, kulahela lika, akayoya naua.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Omo Yesu uahete ku njivo ya Njailusi, katavesele muntu kukovela nendi kuvanga Petulu, na luano, na Yakomba, na vaishe na vaina vauje mumbanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Ha ntsimbu ije, vantu voshe vakele nakulinienga na kulila. Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni kulila, katsile vuno honi nakosa tulo.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Vamujolele, omuo vatantekeyele nguavo natsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Kaha Yesu uaile kuje kumuhela kuakele uje mumbanda kaha uamukuate ku livoko na kumusana nguendi, “Kanike, hinduka!”<verse eid="LUK 8:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Muono uendi uahilukile kaha ha ntsimbu ijevene uemanene. Kaha Yesu ualekele visemi linga vamuhane viakulia alie. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Visemi vendi vali komokelele, kaha Yesu uavashikile keti valeke cipue umo via lingiuile.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu atuma Vandongisi likumi na vavali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mako6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Yesu uasanene vandongisi likumi na vavali veje kuli ikeye, kaha uavahanene nzili yakama ya kuhumisa mahamba voshe na kukanguisa mishongo. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Kaha uavatumine kuya na kuambulula Vumuene vua Njambi na kukanguisa vaka kuvavala. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Uavalekele nguendi, “Keti muambate cuma cimo ha vungenzi vueni, cipue mbueti, cipue cola, cipue viakulia, cipue vimbongo, cipue vikovelo vivali. <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/>Kuoshe kuje kuvaka mitambula muacili, tumameni ku njivo ijevene noho mukahuma mu mbonge ije. <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/>Kuoshe kuje vaka viana kumitambula, kaha humeni mu mbonge ije, kaha totomoneni likungu ku viliato vieni. Eci cikapua cinangulo ku vantu vamuje mu mbonge nge Njambi akavasompesa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Kaha vandongisi vaile, vaihitanganene mu membo oshe na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili na kukanguisa vantu uoshe.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Citanga ca Helonde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mako6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Omo Helonde, muka kusuana mu Ngalileya, uovuile viuma vioshe vialingiuile, kaha uakele na citanga, omuo vantu vamo vakele nakuhandeka nguavo, “Iuano muka kumbuitika nasanguka ku vatsi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>Kaha vamo nguavo, kananguizi ua Njambi Eliya nasholoka, vamo nguavo, “Umo ua tunanguizi va Njambi veka va Njambi valaja nasanguka naua.” <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Kaha Helonde uahandekele nguendi, “Iuano njamutapele mutue, vuno honi iya honi ou yala injili nakuvua viendi?” Kaha uatondele cikuma kumumona Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alisa Vantu vakupua makulukazi atanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateu14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mako6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Iuano6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Tunganda va Yesu vahilukile vamulekele vioshe vije vivalingile. Kaha uaile hamo navo uavatualele kualikaliavo lika ku mbonge ivatumbuile Mbetesainda. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Omo civunga ca vantu vovuile evi, kaha vamukavele. Uavatambuile na kuvalongesa via Vumuene vua Njambi na kukanguisa vaje vakele nakuvavala. <verse eid="LUK 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Omo kuapuile cinguezi, vandongisi vaje likumi na vavali vezile kuli ikeye vahandekele nguavo, “Shandola vivunga evi linga vaye ku membo na ku mehia aua amuyehi vaka liuaneneko viakulia vakevo vavenia noku kuakukosa, omuo muno munapu mu musenge uangoco.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Vuno honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vene vahaneni viakulia linga valie.” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Kutuesi na viakulia vieka kuvanga vimbolo vitanu na vatsi vavali. Nkuma yove utonda tuye na kulanda viakulia via civunga coshe eci ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Kuakele vamala vakupua makulukazi atanu kuakuhona vampuevo na vanike kuje. Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Lekeni vantu vatumame ha mavu mu vimunga, munga na munga mukale vantu makumi atanu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Vandongisi valingile ngacije na vantu voshe vatumamene ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Kaha Yesu uatambuile vije vimbolo vitanu na vatsi vavali, uatalele muilu, kaha uatsatselele kuli Njambi, kaha uavipazuile, uavihanene kuli vandongisi vendi linga vavipangezele vivunga via vantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Voshe valile, vakutile, kaha vandongisi vakunguluile vimbazuvuila vije viasaleleho, vashulisile mitonga likumi na ivali.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu atava nguendi Yesu ikeye Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateu16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mako8:27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakulombela kualikaliendi lika, vandongisi vendi vakele kuyehi nendi. Kaha uavehuile nguendi, “Vantu vali nakunjitumbula nguavo yange iya?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Vamo vali nakuhandeka nguavo yove Iuano Muka kumbuitika, veka naua nguavo yove Eliya, vakuavo naua nguavo yove umo ua tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi valaja uje nasanguka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Yeni honi munjitumbula ngueni yange iya?” Petulu uakumbuluileko nguendi, “Yove Kilistu ua Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Ambahoni Yesu uavashikile nguendi keti valekeko muntu umo cuma eci.<verse eid="LUK 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ahandeka ha Tuyando na Kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-23">Mateu16:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:3-9">Mako8:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Kaha uahandekele naua kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muna Muntu napande kuyanda cikuma, vakuluntu na vakuluntu va vasasendote, na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vaka muviana. Kaha vakamutuala ku kutsa, vuno honi munima ya matangua atatu, akasanguka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupua Ndongisi ua Vusunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:24-28">Mateu16:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mako8:34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele naua kuli vantu voshe vaje vakele kuje nguendi, “Nga muntu atonda kunjikava, napande kuliviana ikeye vavenia, ambate cilindakano cendi ha litangua na litangua, kaha anjikavangeye. <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/>Omuo muntu uje uoshe atonda kuniunga muono uendi auzimbalesa, vuno honi muntu uje voshe azimbalesa muono uendi omuo lizina liange akauuana. <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Nga muntu afuka mavu oshe, vuno honi alinongesa ikeye vavenia na kuzimbalesa muono uendi vika akauanaho? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/>Nga muntu anjuvuila shuamua na vilongesa viange, kaha Muna Muntu naua nendi akamiuvuila shuamua omo akeja mu vumpau vuendi na mu vumpau vua Ishe na mu vumpau vua tungelo vakulela. <verse eid="LUK 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>Mua vusunga njimileka nguange, kuli vamo kuno, vaje kuvakatsi kuvanga vanamono Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulimpuka kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateu17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mako9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Munima ya matangua atanu na atatu omo uahandekele viuma evi, Yesu uaile hamo na Petulu, na Iuano, na Yakomba ku munkinda nakulombela. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Ntsimbu uakele nakulombela, cihanga cendi cahimbukile, kaha vuzalo vuendi vuatokele too ngue ceke. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Hajevene vamala vavali vasholokele vaputukile kuhandeka nendi, vapuile Mosesa na Eliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Vakele mu misha ya muilu. Vakele nakuhandeka na Yesu ha kuija kua kutsa cendi mu Yelusalema muje muakashulisililamo vutumbe vua Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Petulu na vaje vakele navo vakele mu tulo, vuno honi omo vahindukile vamuene misha ya Yesu na vamala vavali vaje vemanene navo. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Omo Mosesa na Eliya vatonde kuya, kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Muene, cacili kuli yetu nga tukala kuno! Tutunga vintsingi vitatu, imo yove, imo ya Mosesa na imo ya Eliya.” Kazivukile vije viakele nakuhandeka. <verse eid="LUK 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ntsimbu Petulu uakele nakuhandeka, lishelua liezile na kuvafuika, kaha vandongisi vazivile liova omo lishelua liavafuikile. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Kaha lizi liahumine mu lishelua liahandekele kuli vakevo ngualio, “Ou ikeye Munange injinahangula, muivuilileni!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Omo lizi liaholokele, Yesu uakele halikaliendi lika. Kaha vandongisi vaholokele kuluu ha viuma vioshe evi, kaha ha ntsimbu ije kuvalekeleko muntu umo viuma vije vivamuene.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa kanike ka yala uje uakele na Lihamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateu17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mako9:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Omo kuacele Yesu na vandongisi vendi vatatu vashulukile ku munkinda, civunga cakama caliuanene na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Yala umo ua haje ha civunga uatambakanene nguendi, “Mulongisi, njikulomba tala munange, omuo ikeye lika umolika. <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>Evi vikevio vikalingika lihamba nga limu uana, kaha atambeka na kushinia na kututumuna lifulu ku kanua, umuvetuesa cikuma kaha kuumuecela vuasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Njalambelelele vandongisi vove nguange vamuhumise vuno honi kuvasele.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Kaha Yesu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vaka kujeneka kutsiliela na vantu vaka vupi! Lungahi honi njikakala neni? Lungahi honi mukeseka kusimpa kuange?” Kaha uahandekele kuli uje yala nguendi, “Neha kuno munove.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Omo kanike uakele nakuija, kaha lihamba liamu uisilile ha mavu na kumushiniisa cikuma. Kaha Yesu uashikile lije lihamba, uje kanike ka yala uakangukile kaha uamuhanene kuli ishe. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Kaha vantu voshe vali komokelele ha nzili yakama ya Njambi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu ahandeka naua ha kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateu17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mako9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Tele vantu voshe vakele nakulikomokela ha vioshe vije Yesu uapangele, kaha uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/>“Ivuilileni keti musuve evi njimileka! Muna Muntu vuavuno amuhana ku nzili ya vantu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Vuno honi vandongisi kuvatantekeyele mucalumbunukile cuma eci. Vavashuekelele linga keti vacitantekeye, vovuile liova liakumuihula vije viahandekele.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uje napu uakama kupulakana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mako9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Kuaputukile vimpata hhakati ka vandongisi linga iya honi uakama kupulakana hhakati kavo. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Yesu uatantekeyele viyongola via mu mitima yavo, nankuma, uasanene kanike uamundende, uamuimikile kunionga yendi, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Uoshe atambula kanike ou mu lizina liange, kaha natambula yange vene, uoshe uje anjitambula, natambula naua uje uanjitumine. Omuo uoshe uje napu uamundende hhakati keni muvavoshe, ikeye napu uakama kupulakana.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uoshe uje kamiluisa ikeye hali hamo neni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mako9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Iuano uahandekele nguendi, “Muene, tuamuene yala umo uakele nakuhumisa mahamba mu lizina liove, kaha tuamulekele linga alikele, omuo ikeye keti uamu munga yetu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Keti mumuvindike, omuo uoshe uje kamiluisa ikeye hali hamo neni.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vamo vaka Samaliya vaviana kutambula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Omo matangua ashuenene kuyehi linga Yesu vamutuale muilu, uatenguluile viyongola viendi, nakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Uatumine vamo va vandongisi vendi kulutue, kaha vaile na kukovela mu limbo lia muka Samaliya linga vaka muvuahesele vualumo kuakuhetela. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Vuno honi vantu vakele kuje kuva mutambuile, omuo vungenzi vuendi vuakele vuakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Omo vandongisi vendi Yakomba na Iuano vamuene evi, vahandekele nguavo, “Muene, utonda linga tusane tuhia tua muilu tuije na kuvanongesa?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatengulukile kuli vakevo na kuvavindika. <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>Kaha vaile ku limbo likuavo.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vaje vatonda kukavangeya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:18-22">Mateu8:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vakele nakuya mu ngila, yala umo uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Njikakukava kuoshe kuuya.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Vambanje vali na vina, na tuzila vali na mashua, vuno honi Muna Muntu kesi naha ha kusatela mutue uendi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli yala mukuavo nguendi, “Njikave.” Vuno honi uje yala uahandekele nguendi, “Muene, ha kulivanga njitave njihiluke njikatsinde tahi tate.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Seza vaka kutsa valitsinde vakevo vavenia. Yove ya na kuambulula via Vumuene vua Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Yala mukuavo uahandekele nguendi, “Njikakukava Muene, vuno honi ha kulivanga njitave njiye njikasalese tahi vavushoko vuange.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nga umo naputuka kulima na vangombe kaha atala kunima vipangi viendi kuvikapu viaseho. Mucifua cimo vene nga umo anjikava kaha atenguluka kunima kuvipangi viendi vialaja kakapu uaseho kupanga vipangi mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Atuma Vandongisi Makumi atanu na avali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Hanima yevi Muene Yesu uahanguile vandongisi makumi atanu na avali vakuavo. Kaha uavatumine kulutue luendi vavali na vavali vaye mu vimbonge namu vihela kuje vavenia uatondele kuya. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Tele kanda vaye uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Kuteja kuakama, vuno honi vaka kuteja vavandende. Kaha ihuleni Muene ua kuteja atume vaka kuteja mu lihia liendi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/>Yeni! Njimituma kupua ngue vampanga mukati ka tungunga. <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/>Keti muambate vikuama cipue vingonga cipue vinkaku, kaha keti mumeneke muntu uoshe mu ngila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>Ntsimbu yoshe nga mukovela mu njivo, cakulivanga handekeni ngueni, ‘Ciyulo cikale mu njivo ino.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/>Nga muli muntu uayulo mu njivo ije, ciyulo ceni cikakala hali vakevo, nga keti ngoco kaha cikamihilukila. <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/>Tumameni mu njivo ije, nueni na kulia vioshe vamihana, omuo muka kupanga napande kutambula fueto yendi. Keti muendangane ku njivo na njivo. <verse eid="LUK 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>Nga mukovela mu mbonge na vantu vamo vamitambula, lieni vivana mivuahesela. <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/>Kanguiseni vaka kuvavala valimo, kaha handekeni kuli vakevo ngueni, ‘Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja muyehi neni.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/>Vuno honi nga mukovela mu mbonge ku vamitambula, kaha yeni mu vingila muhandeke ngueni, <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/>‘Cipue likungu lia mu mbonge yeni lili kumikono yetu tulitotomona linga limilemuise. Vuno honi tantekeyeni eci: Vumuene vua Njambi vuneja.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/>Njimileka, ha litangua lia Cisompelo vukalu vua vantu vamu Sondoma vukapua nahongano kupulakana vantu vamu mbonge ije!<verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anangula Vantu vakuhona kutava</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateu11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>“Tuyando kuli yeni vantu vamu Kolazini! Tuyando kuli yeni naua vantu vamu Mbetesainda! Nga evi vikomoueso vivalingile mu vimbonge vieni, nge njavipangele mu vinganda via vaje keti Vayunda va mu Tile na Sindone vakevo vaje vantu nge vatengulukile laja ha kuzala vijeke naku likuita muto. <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/>Ha litangua lia Cisompelo, vukalu vua vantu vamu Tile na Sindone vukapuako nahongano kupulakana vueni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/>Yeni Vantu va mu Kapenama mutonda vaka mijundule kuheta na kuilu ndi? Houe, vaka mineha ha mavu nakuya mu Ngehena!”<verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Ou evuilila yeni novuilila yange, omuo ou aviana yeni naviana naua yange, kaha nou aviana yange naviana naua nauje ua njitumine.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuihiluka kua vandongi makumi atanu na avali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Vaje makumi atanu na avali vahilukile nakuvuahelela, na kuhandeka nguavo, “Muene mu lizina liove na mahamba a tuvuililile omo tuakele nakuuahumisa!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eyo! Njamuene Satana aua kuilu ngue muhiato. <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/>Taleni, njamihana nzili ya kuliata manoka na manieue, na nzili yoshe ya citozi, kaha na cimo cahi cika mivetuesa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/>Cipue ngocovene, keti muvuahelele hali eci lika, ngueni na mahamba amivuililile, vuno honi vuaheleleni cikuma ngueni mazina eni vana asoneka muilu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Avuahelela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateu11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Ha ntsimbu ijevene Yesu ua vuahelelele mu Cimbembesi ca Kulela kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Njikusatsela Tate, Muene ua muilu na mavu, omuo unashueka viuma evi ku vaka mana na vaka kuzangama kaha uavisholola ku vanike vavandende, cili Tate, eci cikeco ca kuvuaheselele naco.<verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>“Tate nanjihana viuma vioshe. Naumo uahi atantekeya Muana kuvanga Ishe cipue naumo uahi atantekeya Ishe kuvanga Muana. Na Muana akasholola Ishe kuli vaje vatonda.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Kaha uatengulukile kuli vandongisi vendi na kuhandeka kuli vakevo ku mukulo nguendi, “Avezika aje mesho amona vije vimu mona! <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/>Njimileka nguange vavengi tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi na vamiene vazangele kumona vimumona, vuno honi kuva vimuene, naua vatondele kuivua vimuli na kuivua, vuno honi kuva vivuile.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka Samaliya Uacili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Hajevene mulongisi ua mashiko uemanene kueseka Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi,” “Njilinge vati njikakale na muono ua yaye?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu uamuihuile nguendi, “Vika vanasoneka mu Lishiko lia Mosesa? Vika ukatandamo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Zanga Muene Njambi yove na mutima uove uoshe, na muono uove uoshe, na nzili yove yoshe, na visinganieka viove vioshe, kaha zanga mukueni ngue omo nalivanga yove vavenia.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Uahandeka muacili, linga eci, kaha ukakala muono ua yaye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Vuno honi uje mulongisi uatondele kulimuesa ikeye vavenia, uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mukuetu ikeye iya?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile mu cisimo nguendi, “Litangua limo kuakele yala umo uahumine ku Yelusalema nakuya ku Yeliko, kaha ua liuanene na vezi. Vamuivilile vuzalo vuendi, na kumuveta na kuteua, na kumuseza na lezumuka. <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/>Kaha capuile nge cakukasumuka, kasasendote uaile mu ngila ijevene, kaha omo uamuene ou yala, uamuongolokele kumukulo. <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/>Na Kalevi naua omo uahete kucihela cije uamumuene nendi naua kaha uamuongolokele. <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/>Kaha ka Samaliya umo uakele nakuhita mu ngila ije, omo uahete kucihela cije kuakosele uje yala kaha ua mumuene, kaha ua muivuilile cikeketima. <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/>Uashuenene kuyehi na kumuzenga ha vimbandu, kaha uamuhakeleho mazi na viniu. Kaha uamuhakele ha Cimulu cendi na kumutuala ku njivo ya vangenzi, naku kamuniungilako. <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/>Hakuca ca litangua uambate vimbongo viamu uayauaya vivali na kuhana muka kuniunga njivo ya vangenzi, kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Umuniunge muacili,’ kaha omo njikahiluka nja kukufueta vioshe vije viulinakulikuasesa.”<verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>Hanima yevi Yesu uehuile uje mulongisi ua mezi a mashiko a Mosesa nguendi, “Iya hhakati ka vantu ava vatatu uje uapuile ngue mukuavo ou yala, uje uauililile mu mavoko a vezi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Uje uamumuesele ngozi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Kaha hanima yevi Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Eyo, ya ukalinge ngoco.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Ameneka Mata na maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Omo Yesu na vandongisi vendi vaile mu ngila, vahete hembo haje hakele mpuevo ua lizina lia Mata ikeye uamutambuile mu njivo yendi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Uakele na munaina Maliya, ou ua tumamene ku viliato via Yesu na kuivuilila viakele na kuhandeka. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Vuno honi Mata uakele nakulinga vipangi viavingi, kaha uezile kuli Yesu na kumuihula nguendi, “Muene, kuumono munanana na njecelela vipangi vioshe likaliange? Muleke anjikuaseko.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Mata, Mata, yove ua lijujukila na kunienguela vipangi viavingi. <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/>Vuno honi cuma cimo citondeka. Maliya na hangula cuma cacili, oco ku cikahumisila kuli ikeye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Avalongesa Kulombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateu6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Litangua limo Yesu uakele kumuhela umo na kulombela kuli Njambi. Omo uamanesele kulombela, umo ua vandongisi vendi uamuhandekesele nguendi, “Muene tulongese kulombela, ngue Iuano muka kumbuitika muana longeselele vandongisi vendi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Yesu uavalekele nguendi, “Omo mulombela kuli Njambi lombeleni ngueni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tatetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">valemese lizina liove lia kulela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">vumuene vuove vuije.<verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>Tuhaneni cakulia cije tutonda litangua na litangua.<verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>Tukonekele ku vipi vuetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">omuo netu tukakonekela vantu vaka kutuvulumuina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">keti ututuamenene muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Singaniekeni nge uli na kavusamba kove kaha uyako mukati kavutsiki na kumuhandekesa na kumulomba nguove, ‘Kavusamba, njantsantela njilombako vimbolo vitatu lika, <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/>Kavusamba kange neja muvungezi vua kunjimenekela kaha kujesi naviakulia viaku mujumbula!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/>Kaha uje kavusamba kove oku hali mu njivo akutava, ‘Keti unjitanganese njapata laja ku njivo kaha yange na vana vange tuakoso laja, Kunjasa kuhinduka na kukuhana cimo naua.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/>Njimileka nguange, cipue ngocovene kakahinduka na kukuhana viakulia omuo uapua kavusamba kove, vuno honi akahinduka na kukuhana vioshe vije viutonda omuo akaziva shuamua kuakuhona kukuhana. <verse eid="LUK 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>Kaha njimileka nguange, lombeni, kaha vakamihana, tondeni kaha mukauana, toteni kaha vaka mishokoliela. <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/>Uoshe uje alomba akatambula, kaha uoshe uje atonda akauana, kaha kuli uje atota vaka mushokoluela. <verse eid="LUK 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>Iya ishe hhakati keni, nga munendi amulomba itsi, kaha ikeye amuhana linoka? <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/>Cipue nga amulomba mayaki amuhana linieue? <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/>Nga yeni, vaka vupi mutantekeya kuhana viacili kuli vana veni, kaha honi Ishueni ua muilu akahanavene Cimbembesi ca Kulela kuli vaje vamulomba!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mbelezembulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateu12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mako3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Litangua limo Yesu uakele nakuhumisa lihamba lije vialingikile muntu kupua kaveveve. Omo lije lihamba liahumine kaha uje yala uaputukile kuhandeka. Omo vantu vamuene evi valikomokelele. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Vuno honi vamo vavo vahandekele nguavo, “Nahumisa lihamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu mukuluntu ua mahamba.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Kaha vamo vatondele kumueseka, lingahoni vamulombele linga apange cikomoueso cije cimuesa nge Njambi ikeye namutumu. <verse eid="LUK 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Vuno honi Yesu ua tantekeyele vili mu mitima yavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga vantu vavumuene vumo valiluisa hhakati kavo vumuene vuje vukahua. Nga vantu vanjivo imo valiluisa hhakati kavo kaha ije njivo ikaua. <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/>Nga vumuene vua Satana vuli navimunga vililuisa vikevio vavenia, kaha vumuene vuendi vukakola vatihoni? Njinehula eci omuo yeni muhandeka ngueni, njikahumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/>Honi nga njihumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Mbelezembulu, kaha vandongisi veni vaka likuasesa nzili yeya omo muvakahumisa mahamba? Eci cikeco vandongisi veni vaka mihisa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/>Nga njihumisa mahamba mu nzili ya Njambi, kaha vumuene vua Njambi vuneja kuli yeni.<verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>“Omo nga yala ua nzili nalivuahesela laja vitua viendi aniunga njivo yendi, kaha vupite vuendi vuoshe vukaniungiua muacili. <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/>Nga uje hali na nzili ya kupulakana eje nakuluisa mukuavo na kumuhiana kaha akambata vitua vioshe via uje via kulahelele. Kaha akalipangezela na vakuavo vije vioshe vianambata.<verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>“Kaha uoshe uje kesi kumutambela uange, muavusunga ikeye anjiluisa, kaha uoshe uje kakunguluka nange akashandola.<verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhiluka kua lihamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateu12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>“Omo lihamba lihuma muli muntu, kaha liendakana mu mpambo kutalezeka muhela uakuhuimina. Nga kuliasa kuuana muhela kaha lilihandekesa likelio vavenia ngualio, ‘Njihiluka kuli muntu kuje njahumine.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/>Kaha omo lihiluka liuana muhela uje uakulela vanauhaka muacili. <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/>Kaha liya na kuneha vatanu na vavali mahamba veka vakupihia cikuma kupulakana likelio kaha vakovelamo na kukalamo. Kaha kupihia kua muntu uje kuakukotokela kupulakana kuje kua kuli vanga!”<verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vikuisulo via vusunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Omo Yesu uakele nakuhandeka vije, mpuevo umo uamuje mu civunga uje uakele nakuivuilila evi uatambakanene cikuma na kuhandeka nguendi, “Uakukuisula uje mpuevo uakusemene na kukulela!” <verse eid="LUK 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vakukuisula cikuma vaje vovua lizi lia Njambi naku likava!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Valomba Yesu cikomoueso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateu12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Omo civunga ca vantu calivuezelelele, Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Vantu vavapi va matangua ano vatonda lika cikomoueso vuno honi kuvacimono, kuvanga lika cikomoueso ca Yona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/>Ngue Yona uapuile cimueso ca vantu vamu Nanive, kaha Muna Muntu akapua cimueso ca vantu va matangua ano. <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/>Muene uampuevo uaku Sheva akemana nakuluisa vantu va matangua ano ha litangua lia cisompelo na kuvahisa. Uahuminine kulahako kuakuivua mana a Solomoni. Kaha honi taleni! Umo uakupulakana Solomoni hali kuno, vuno honi muviana kumuivuila. <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/>Vantu vaku Nanive vaka katuka nakuluisa vantu vamatangua ano ha litangua lia cisompelo naku vahisa. Vantu vaku Nanive vatengulukile ku vilinga viavo via vipi omo vovuile kuambulula kua Yona. Taleni honi! Uakama cikuma kupulakana Yona halikuno vuno honi muviana kumuvuilila!<verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ceke ca muvila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateu5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>“Naumo uahi asa kushuameka ndeya yendi naku ishueka cipue kuifuika na liendeko vuno honi ihaka haci tumbiko, kaha linga uoshe uje akovela mu njivo amone ceke. <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/>Mesho ove akeuo ceke ca muvila uove. Nga mesho ove amona muacili kaha muvila uoshe ukashula na ceke, vuno honi nga mesho ove avavala kaha muvila uoshe ukapua na milima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/>Kaha tantekeya muacili nguove ceke cili muli yove keti cipue milima. <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/>Nga muvila uove uoshe uashulu na ceke, kua kuhona kapenga kamilima, kaha ukashula na ceke ngue muje ndeya muikaneha misha hali yove.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu atenukila Vafaliseo na Valongisi va mezi a Mashiko a Mosesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Omo Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka, Kafaliseo umo uamulaniene linga akalie nendi. Kaha Yesu uakovelele na kutumama nakulia hamo nendi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Kafaliseo ualikomokelele omo uamuene Yesu katanene ku mavoko endi mukulia. <verse eid="LUK 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Taleni yeni Vafaliseo muka lelesa hambanza na lilonga helu, vuno honi mukati keni muashulu na lizangamena na vupi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/>Yeni vilema! Kumutantekeya ngueni, Njambi uatangele helu lieni, ikeye naua uatangele mukati ndi? <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/>Haneni ku tuhutu muje mumuzivukila mu mitima yeni ngueni tunapande kuviana, kaha mukapua vakulela kuli Njambi cipue kuakuhona kutana ku mavoko eni.<verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>“Tuyando kuli yeni Vafaliseo! Yeni mukahana kuli Njambi camulikumi ha viuma mukatepesa kuvia kulia ngue minte, na luku, na visapa-sapa vikuavo, vuno honi kumuekulinga muacili vantu naua kumuazangele Njambi. Evi munapande kuvilinga kuakuhona kulikela kuli vije vikuavo.<verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>“Tuyando tueni, Vafaliseo! Yeni muazanga kutumama ha vituamo viacili mu vinjivo via malombelo, kaha muzanga vantu kumikandelela na kumihana kasingimiko mu mihela yakulandesela. <verse eid="LUK 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>Tuyando tueni, omuo yeni muapua ngue vihilo vije viakuhona kumoneka. Vantu vakendeho nakupua vaka vupi kuakuhona kutantekeya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Kaha umo ua valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi, omo uli na kuhandeka evi, uli nakushaula yetu naua.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Tuyando tueni, yeni naua valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa! Omuo mukatuika vantu vituika via kulema vuno honi yeni vavenia kumuekukakulako cipue na munie umo kukuasa vaje vajundula vije viteli. <verse eid="LUK 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>Tuyando tueni, omuo mukavuahesa ha vihilo via tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi vaje vavatsihile vakukuluila veni. <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/>Nkuma yeni mulinavukaleho vuje mutava vije vivalingile vaje vakukuluila veni. Vatsihile tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi na yeni muatungile vihilo viavo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/>Kaha cuma eci mana a Njambi ahandeka nguauo, ‘Njikavatumina tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi na tunganda kaha vakatsihaho vamo vavo na vamo naua muka vayandesa cikuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/>Nkuma vantu va ntsimbu ino vaka vazangamesa ha kutsiha tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi voshe hume hakutanga kua lifuti, <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/>hume hakutsiha Avele nakuheta ha kutsiha Zakaliya uje vatsihilile mukati ka mutula ha Muhela Uakulela. Njimileka nguange, vantu va ntsimbu ino vaka vazangamesa voshe hali evi.<verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>“Tuyando tueni, valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa! Omuo munanieke vantu sapi yakushokoluesa ku cikolo ca mangana, vuno honi yeni vavenia kumue kukovelamo, cipue vaje veseka kukovelamo kumue kuvatavesa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Omo Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka evi, uahumine kucihela kuje. Valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na Vafaliseo vaputukile kumuluisa cikuma na kumuihula vihula viavingi vakumunienguesa. <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>Vavandamenene indi nga ahandeka via vipi linga vamukuateho.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s">Cinangulo ha civembulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateu10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Ha ntsimbu ije vene vivunga viakama via vantu vavengi viakungulukile hamo, vapuile vavengi mukemuo vakele na kuliliatangela umo na mukuavo, Yesu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Liniungeni ku cimbaluila ca Vafaliseo, cije cikeco civembulu cavo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/>Keti mupue ngue vakevo omuo nacimo cahi ca kufuika ku cikafukuliua, cipue ca kushueka kuci kajomboloka. <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/>Viunahandeka mu milima vaka viziva mu mutania, nevi uayevetela kumuhela vaka vihandeka hambanza.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uje uakuteua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateu10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>“Njimileka vavusamba keti muteue atsiha muvila kaha kuhumaho kasa naua kulinga cuma cimo. <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/>Vuno honi njimileka uje imunapande kuteua. Muteue uje nga namanesa kutsiha muvila, hanga hali na nzili yaku miumbila mu ngehena. Eyo, njimileka muteueni.” <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/>“Singaniekeni tumpiasa, kutuesi naseho cipue tutanu vatulanda ha vimbingo vivali. Vuno honi naumo uahi uavo vakamusuva kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/>Vuno honi cipue vinkambu viaku mutue uove vana vitanda. Keti muteue, muli naseho yakama cikuma kupulakana tumpiasa vavengi.<verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutava Yesu cipue Kumuviana ku mesho a Vantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mateu10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>“Njimileka nguange uoshe uje ahandeka hacivunga nguendi uakundama kuli yange, na Muna Muntu naua aka muhandeka ku tungelo va Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/>Vuno honi uoshe uje anjiviana hakati ka civunga ca vantu, nange njikamuviana ku tungelo va Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/>“Uoshe ashaula Muna Muntu vaka musambesa, vuno honi uoshe atuka Cimbembesi Uakulela ku vaka musambesa.<verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>“Omo vakamituala mu vinjivo via malombelo kuli vaka kuyula na vaka nzili mukumieseka, keti mukalinienge mu mukaliluila yeni vavenia, kuli vimukahandeka na muje mu mukavakumbuiluila, <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/>omuo Cimbembesi Uakulela cikamilongesa ha ntsimbu ije vimuapande kukahandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka Kufuka ua Cilema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Muntu umo uakele muje mu civunga uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi, leka muanetu linga tulipangele vitenga vije tate uatusezelelele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Kavusamba, iya nanjihangula kupua muka kuyula cipue muka kuimanena hhakati keni?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Liniungeni! Zangameni ku miyati ya lizangamena lioshe: vuyoye vua muntu kuvuesi mu vufuko vuendi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Kaha uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuakele muntu umo uakufuka mu lihia liendi muakele viakuteja viavingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/>Kaha uasinganiekele ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Njikalinga vati, omuo kunjesi na vishete viakama via kutulikila viakuteja viange?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>Kaha naua uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njikalinga eci, njikasiula vishete viange na kutunga viakama, muje mukemo njikahaka vimbuto viange na viuma viange vioshe. <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/>Kaha njikahandeka ku muono uange nguange, Muono, uli na viuma viavingi unalitumbikila ha miaka yaingi, huima, lia, nua na kuvuahelela.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>Vuno honi Njambi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove cilema! Vutsiki vuno vene muono uove vauambata. Kaha vije viuma viuna livuahesela vikapua vieya?’<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>“Omu mukemuo mucikapua kuli muntu uje, vikakala navaje vakalitulikila vufuko vakevo vavenia vuno honi kuva fukile ku mesho a Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Keti Mulinienge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateu6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Nankuma njimileka nguange, keti mulinienge ha vuyoye vueni vimukalia, cipue via muvila ueni vimukazala. <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/>Omuo vuyoye vunapu vuaseho kupulakana viakulia, na muvila kupulakana vuzalo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/>Singaniekeni makololo kuve kulima cipue kuteja, kuvakele na cishete cipue muakutulikila viakulia, vuno honi Njambi alina kuvalisa. Yeni muvaseho cikuma kupulakana tuzila. <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/>Iya hhakati keni mu kulinienga asa kuhakelako cipue ka ntsimbu kakandende ku vuyoye vuendi? <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/>Nga kumuasa kulinga eci cuma cacindende, kaha vika muliniengela ha vioshe? <verse eid="LUK 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>Singaniekeni vintemo muvikakolela: Kuvie kupanga cipue kulizika. Vuno honi njimileka nguange, cipue vene muene Solomoni mu vufuko vuendi vuoshe kazalele ngue vuzalo ngue vua evi. <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/>Nga omu mukemo Njambi akazikilamo vishoni via musenge, vije vikalako lika lelo kaha imene vavintsimika mu tuhia, yeni akamizika cikuma, keti mukale nalikulahelo lialindende ngacije.”<verse eid="LUK 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/>“Keti mutualeleleho kulinienge hali vimu kalia cipue vimu kanua. <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/>Vaka lifuti vakevo vakatondo evi vioshe viuma. Vuno honi yeni Ishueni azivuka nguendi muvitonda. <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/>Vuno honi tondeni tahi vumuene vua Njambi, kaha navioshe evi vaka mihanavio naua.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vufuko vua Muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateu6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>“Keti muvue liova yeni mpunga yaindende, Ishueni navuahelela kumihana vumuene. <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/>Landeseni vufuko vueni nakuvuhana vimbongo kuli tuhutu. Livuaheseleni vikuama vieni vavenia vije kuvikapihia, vukevuo vufuko vua muilu vuje kuvuekuhua cipue vezi kuvasa kuvushuena na tuntembulu kuvasa kuvupihisa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/>Oko kuli vufuko vuove, kukeko kukakala mutima uove.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba uakutalelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>“Livuaheseleleni vipangi na vindeya vieni vishuame. <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/>Pueni ngue vangamba vavandamena Muene uavo ahuma ku cilika cavulo. Omo nge eja nakutota ku cikolo ohovene kaha va mushokuelela. <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/>Vanavezika vaje vangamba omo Muene uavo akavauana vatona na kulivuahesela nge eja. Njimileka muavusunga, Muene uavo akalizitika muiva uendi na kuvalania vatumame ku mesa na kuvahana viakulia.” <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/>Vavezika vangamba vaje nga Muene uavo eja avauana vanalivuahesela vualuno cipue eje hhakati ka vutsiki cipue akasholoka hanima. <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/>Naua Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi nguendi tantekeyeni eci, “Nga vavenia njivo akatantekeya ntsimbu ije muizi akeja, nge kekuseza njivo yendi vaituve. <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/>Neni naua muapande kuli vuahesela, omuo Muna Muntu akeja ha ntsimbu kumua livuaheselele.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngamba uakulongua na Uakuhona kulongua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateu24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petulu uehuile nguendi, “Muene, uli nakutulekesa eci cisimo yetu lika indi na voshe?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Muene Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Kuakele ngamba ua mana na lutsilielo. Muene uendi uamuhakele kuendesa vakuavo vangamba nakukahana viakulia ha ntsimbu yatelamo. <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/>Uakukuisula uje ngamba omo Muene uendi ahiluka amuuana hali laja kuvipangi. <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/>Njimileka muavusunga, Muene uendi akamupuisa kupua mukuluntu ua vufuko vuendi vioshe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/>Vuno honi vije vikalingika nga uje ngamba halihandekesa ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Muene uange nakotokela ha kuhiluka,’ kaha akaputuka kupupa vangamba vakuavo, va vamala nava va vampuevo na kulia na kunua na kupenda? <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/>Nga Muene ua uje ngamba akahiluka ha litangua olio kamuvandamene na ola ije katantekeyele, akamutetanga vimpindi na kumuhaka hamo nava kakuhona kutava.<verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>“Nga ngamba uje atantekeya viatonda Muene uendi, vuno honi kuvivuahesa kuahi cipue kalingi viatonda Muene uendi vaka mupupa na vimbanda viavingi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/>Vuno honi uje katantekeya Muene uendi viatonda, kaha alinga viuma viafuila kashitiku vaka mupupa vimbanda viavindende. Kuli uoshe vanahana viavingi, viavingi naua vakatonda, kuli uje vanatulikisile viavingi, viavingi cikuma vakamuihula.<verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vantu valiangununa omuo Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateu10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>“Njezile nakuneha tuhia ha mavu, njatondo nge tunakuata laja! <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/>Ha kulivanga njapandele kuhita mu cimbuitikilo ca tuyando tuatuingi, njinazeye kuvanga cinahiti! <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/>Muasinganieka ngueni njinezile mukuneha ciyulo ha mavu? Houe, njimileka vuno honi njinanehe kulitepa. <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/>Kuhuma hano ntanga ya vantu vatanu vakalitepa, vatatu valiluisa na vavali kaha vavali valiluisa na vatatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/>Vakalipanga, vaishe valuisa vana va vamala, na va vamala kuluisa vaishavo, vaina kuluisa vana vavo va vampuevo kaha na vana va vampuevo kuluisa vainavo, vaina mueno kuluisa vaniotomueno yavo, vaina mueno kuluisa vaniotomueno yavo.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulumbununa vitantekeyeso via vintsimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mateu16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Yesu uahandekele ku civunga nguendi, “Nga mumona lishelua lihuminina kuli katokela litangua, vuasi vuasi muhandeka ngueni, ‘Ikanoka’, kaha inoka. <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/>Kaha nga muvua mpunzi ihuminina mu mbuela, muhandeke ngueni, ‘Kukayukuma’, kaha mukemo vene. <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/>Yeni vaka civembulu! Muatantekeya kulumbununa cifua ca mavu cipue ca melu, vuno honi vika kumutantekeyela kulumbununa viuma vije Njambi alina kulinga ha vintsimbu vino tulimo?<verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulisambesa na Muka Nkole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateu5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>“Vika muhonoua kuli yula yeni vavenia hakulinga viuma viacili? <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/>Nga uya na citozi cove kunzango, eseka cikuma kulivuasana nendi mu ngila. Nga kuahi akakutuala kuli muka kuyula, kaha muka kuyula akakutuala kuli mukuluntu ua kamenga kaha akakutuala mu kamenga. <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/>Njimileka yeni nguange kumukahumumo kuvanga noho mukafueta vimbongo viama maneselelo via mukuli.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s">Kutengulukeni kuvupi vueni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Ha ntsimbu ije kuakele vantu vamo valekele Yesu via Vangalileya vaje Pilato uatsihile te valinakulinga vinkombelo viavo kuli Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Omuo Vangalileya vaje vavatsihile mu ngila ije vene, kaha yeni muayongola ngueni vapuile vaka vupi kupulakana Vangalileya voshe ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/>Njimileka nguange, kuahi! Vuno honi nga kumutenguluka mukanonga ngue vakevo naua. <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/>Singaniekeni vaje vantu likumi na vatanu na vatatu vaje vatsile omo kaposhi ka mu Siloame kavauililile. Musinganieka ngueni vapuile vaka vupi kupulakana voshe vaje vakele mu Yelusalema ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/>Njimileka nguange, kuahi! Vuno honi kuvanga mutenguluke keti ngoconi mukanonga ngue vakevo naua.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muti ua Mukuyu uakuhona kuima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Kaha Yesu uavatele cisimo eci, “Kuakele yala umo uakunine muti ua mukuyu mu lihia liendi. Kaha uaile nakumonako vushuka vuno honi kavuuaneneko. <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli ndimi yendi nguendi, ‘Tala, mu miaka itatu njinakele nakuija nakutondako vushuka oku ku muti ua mukuyu, hanga nakamo kanjinauanako kahi. Uteke! Vikahoni utualelelaho kushamuisa livu eli?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>Vuno honi uje ndimi uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Muene, acitaleleleniko muaka umo naua, njikahindako kuuzengeleka nakuhakako vuilo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/>Nga ukema vushuka mungolosika, kaha muacili, vuno honi nga kuukemi, ambahoni njikauteka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa mpuevo ua cilema ha Litangua lia Sapalalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Ha litangua limo lia Sapalalo Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya malombelo. <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>Kaha kuakele mpuevo muje uakele na lihamba lije liamu vavalesele miaka likumi na itanu na itatu. Kaha ikeye uakotamene kasele kuhetuka kuahi. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Omo Yesu uamumuene, uamusanene nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Mpuevo, njikukangula ku kuvavala kuove.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Kaha Yesu uakambekele mavoko endi hali ikeye, hajevene uolokele na kuputuka kushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Vuno honi mukuluntu ua mu njivo ya malombelo uanienguele omuo Yesu uakanguisile muntu ha litangua lia Sapalalo, uakele na kuhandeka ku vantu nguendi, “Kuli matangua atanu na limo aje tunapande kupanga vipangi. Ijeni mu matangua aje linga vamikanguise, keti ha litangua lia Sapalalo, kuahi.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Vuno honi Muene Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Eni vaka civembulu! Nkuma yeni kumue kuzitula vangombe yeni cipue vimulu ceni nakumutuala ku mema ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi? <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/>Taleni ou Mpuevo! Ikeye mutekulu ua Avilahama uje yakutile Satana miaka likumi na itanu na itatu. Nkuma kuvapandele kumuzitula ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Kukumbulula nguendi kuazivisile vitozi vendi voshe shuamua, kaha vantu voshe vajolelelele ha viuma viakukomokesa viacili vije vialingile.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbuto ya musalata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateu13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mako4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi vunapu ngue vika? Njivuesekesa na vika? <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/>Vunapu ngue muje, muntu anona kanona kamo kambuto ya musalata nakukakuna mu lihia citungu. Kaha kakakola kapua muti uakama, kaha tuzila veja vakutungila mashua avo ku mintango yauo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Cimbaluila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateu13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Kaha naua Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi njivuesekesa na vika? <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/>Vunapu ngue cimbaluila cije mpuevo uanonele na kuutsingasana na vunga vua vuingi vua tiliku mu lilonga, noho mukasha uoshe uafutunukile.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cikolo ca Cindende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mateu7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Yesu uahitile mu Vinganda na mu membo, ualongesele vantu oku hali mu vungenzi vuakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Kaha umo uamuhuile nguendi, “Muene, nkuma vavandende lika vakovoka ndi?” Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/>“Licikinineni mukovele mu cikolo ca cindende, muavusunga omuo vavengi vakatonda ku kovelamo vuno honi kuvakasa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/>Omo vavenia njivo akemana na kushoka lipito, kaha mukemana hambanza na kutota ha lipito ngueni, ‘Muene, tushokolueleko!’ Kaha akamikumbulula nguendi, ‘Kunjitantekeya oku kumuhuma.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>Kaha mukaputuka kuhandeka ngueni, ‘Tualile na kunua nove, kaha ualongesele mu nganda yetu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>Vuno honi akahandeka naua nguendi, ‘Kunjitantekeya oku muhuma. Humeni kuli yange, yeni voshe vaka kulinga viavipi!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>Mukalila na kulishumanga ku mazo omo mukamona Avilahama, na Isake na Yakomba na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi voshe mu Vumuene vua Njambi, vuno honi yeni vakamiumbila hambanza. <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/>Vantu vakahuma mu ngangela na mu kangombe ka yambi, ku kunto na mu mbuela, vakatumama ku ciuano mu Vumuene vua Njambi. <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/>Cilivene vaka kukotokela vakapua vaka kulivanga, kaha vaka kulivanga vakapua vakevo vaka kukotokela.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cizango ca Yesu ha Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateu23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Ha ntsimbu ijevene kuezile Vafaliseo vamo kuli Yesu na ku handeka nguavo, “Unapande kuhuma kuno uye kueka, omuo Helonde atonda kukutsiha.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni mukamuleke ouo mbanje ngueni, ‘Njicili nakuhumisa mahamba na kukanguisa vantu kumavezi avo ku litangua lialelo na imene, kaha ha litangua lia mucitatu ambahoni njikamanesa vipangi viange.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/>Cipue ngoco njinapandele kuenda lelo na imene na imenuavuze, omuo keti cacili kuli kananguizi ua Njambi kutsila kueka vuno honi kuvanga mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>Yelusalema, Yelusalema, yove mu kakutsiha tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi nakuasha mavue kuli vaje vavakutumina! Vintsimbu viavingi njatondele kukungulula vantu vove hamolika ngue cali muakavutikiya vana vendi mu mambava endi, vuno honi yove kuuanjitavele! <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/>Tala, njivo yove ikasala ya mupulungua. Njikuleka nguange, kuukanjimono naua kuvanga noho ntsimbu ikeja omo ukahandeka nguove, ‘Uakuvezika ou eja mulizina lia Muene.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala uakuvavala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Ha ntsimbu imo omo Yesu uaile ku njivo ya mukuluntu ua Vafaliseo na kulia via kulia ha litangua lia Sapalalo, voshe vaje vakele mu njivo vakele na kumutalela muyehi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Ha lutue luendi hakele yala uakele nakuvavala kuzimba mikono uezile kuli Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu uehuisile Vafaliseo na valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa nguendi, “Cinapu cacili kuli Lishiko lietu ku kanguisa vantu ha litangua lia Sapalalo, indi kuahi?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Vuno honi vaholokele. Kaha Yesu uamuambate uje yala uakuvavala na kumukanguisa, nakumuecela aye. <verse eid="LUK 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nga hhakati keni hali umo hali na muana cipue ngombe uje nauila mulisima, kumuasa ku muhumisamo ha litangua lia Sapalalo ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Kaha vahonouele kumukumbulula eci.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulikehesa na kutambula vangenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Omo Yesu uamuene vangenzi vanahangula vihela via vituamo viakama, uavatelele cisimo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/>“Omo nga vanakulaniako ku cilika cavulo, keti ukatumame ha cituamo ca kasingimiko, omuo hamo kuli umo ua kasingimiko kupulakana yove ivanalania. <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/>Kaha uje uamilaniene muvavoshe a kahandeka kuli yove nguendi, ‘Njimilomba mutumameko kuje linga ou yala atumameko ha cihela ceni.’ Kaha mushuamua ukambata cituamo ca cindende kumaneselela. <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/>Vuno honi nga vanakulania, ya ukatumame ha cituamo ca cindende ca kumaneselela, nga vavenia cilika akeja, akahandeka kuli yove nguendi, ‘Kavusamba, tumama ku cituamo ca kasingimiko,’ kaha uka tumama na kasingimiko kuli voshe ukatumama navo ku mesa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/>Kaha voshe vaka lijundula vakevo vavenia va kavaneha ha mavu, kaha voshe vakalikehesa vakevo vavenia vakajundula.” <verse eid="LUK 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli uje uamulaniene nguendi, “Nga uhana viakulia ha ciuano, keti lika ulanie vavusamba cipue va ndumbuevo cipue vavushoko vove cipue vakufuka vamua lihata navo, hamo vakamisana navakevo naua, kaha cikamuesa ngue vali nakumifueta. <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/>Vuno honi nga uana viakulia ha ciuano, lania vihutu, na visualonda, na vilema na tupuputua. <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/>Nga ulinga muje ukapua uakuvezika, omuo kuvakasa kukufueta, kaha vaka kufueta ha kusanguka ca vaka vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca ciuano cakama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateu22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Umo mungenzi ivalaniene kukulia omo uovuile eci, uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “uakukuisula uje akatumama ku ciuano mu vumuene vua Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuakele muntu umo uje ualingile ciuano cakama kaha ualaniene vantu vavengi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/>Ha ntsimbu ya ciuano uatumine vangamba kuli vaje valaniene nguendi, ‘Ijeni, omuo vioshe vinavua honi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>Kaha umo na umo uakele nakuhandeka nguendi nazenzama. Uakulivanga ua handekele nguendi, ‘Njinalanda lihia, kaha njitonda njikalimone, tambula kulomba kuange.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>Mukuavo uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njinalanda vangombe likumi, kaha njili nakuya na kuveseka, tambula kulomba kuange.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>Mukuavo naua uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njinambata mpuevo vene, kaha kunjasa kuija.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>Kaha uje ngamba uahilukile na kuambulula kuli Muene yendi. Kaha vavenia njivo uanienguele kaha uahandekele kuli ngamba yendi nguendi, ‘Ya hano vene muvingila na mu vitapalo via mbonge unehe vihutu, na visualonda, na tupuputua na vilema.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>Omo ngamba yendi uahilukile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, viunashikile via lingiua, vuno honi kuhucili muhela.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>Kaha Muene uahandekele kuli ngamba yendi nguendi, ‘Ya mu vingila via mumikulo na mu vitapalo via mumikulo, usindiye vantu veje vakovele mu njivo yange linga ishule. <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/>Kaha njikuleka nguange naumo uahi kuli vaje vanjinalaniene a kevua ku viakulia viange!’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndongisi napande kulivuahesela kuyandela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mateu10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Litangua limo omo vantu vavengi vaile na Yesu, kaha ualulukile na kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/>“Uoshe uje eja kuli yange vuno honi kazindi va ishe na vaina, mpuevo yendi na vana vendi, na vandumbuendi na vamuanaye va vampuevo, cilivene, cipue ukeuo muono uendi, kasa kupua ndongisi uange. <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/>Uoshe uje kambata cilindakano cendi na kunjikava kasa kupua ndongisi uange. <verse eid="LUK 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>Nga utonda kutunga njivo yakama, kaha utumama ha mavu na kumona vije vitondeka, kumona nga uasa kuimanusula. <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/>Vuno honi nga uaputuka kuhinda luvula kaha uonoua kuimanesa, voshe vakaimona kaha vakakujola <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/>na kuhandeka nguavo, ‘Uje mukuetu uaputukile kutunga vuno honi nahonoua.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>Cipue muene, nga aya ku nzita na kulua na mukuavo muene, kaha atumama ha mavu na kumona nga asa kulua na vantu va kupua makulukazi likumi na uje mukuavo eja na vantu vakupua makulukazi makumi avali. <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/>Nga kasa, kaha omo mukuavo acili kulahako, akatumako vantu vakahandeke via ciyulo. <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/>Mucifua cimo vene,” “naumo uahi hali yeni apua ndongisi uange nga kaseze vioshe vianafuku.<verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muongua ua kushamuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateu5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mako9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>“Muongua uapua uacili, vuno honi nga uashamuka kaha kutovala caco cihiluka vati? <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/>Kuukapu uacili ku mavu cipue ku vuilo, vaka umbila kuti. Uoshe hali na matuitui, napande kuivua evi!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Mpanga ua kuzimbala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:12-14">Mateu8:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Litangua limo omo vaka kutambula lisimu na vaka vupi vezile na kuivuilila Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>kaha Vafaliseo na valongisi va mezi a mashiko a Mosesa vakele nakuningozola na kuhandeka nguavo, “Ou yala linakutambula vaka vupi na kulia navo.” <verse eid="LUK 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Kaha Yesu uava telele cisimo eci nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/>“Iya hali yeni nga hali na Vampanga cihita kaha azimbalesaho umo, nkuma kaseze vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana (99) mu musenge na kuya nakutonda uje nazimbala kuvanga noho na muuana? <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/>Nga namuuana, avuahelela na kumuhaka ha vitsili viendi, <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/>omo ha kuya kuimbo, kaha akasana vavusamba vendi nava va lihata navo kaha akahandeka nguendi, ‘Vuaheleleni hamo nange omuo njinauana mpanga uange uje uazimbalele.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/>Njimileka nguange, mucifua cimo vene kukapua kuvuahelela kuakama muilu hali muka vupi umo nga natenguluka kupulakana vaje makumi atanu na auana na vatanu na vauana vantu vaje kuvatondo kutenguluka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbongo ya kuzimbala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>Yesu uatualeleleho kuleka vantu cisimo eci nguendi, “Nga mpuevo umo ali na vimbongo via mu uayauaya likumi, nga hazimbala imo, nkuma kashuameka ndeya yendi, nakukomba mu njivo na kutonda vuino kuvanga noho hakaiuanena? <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/>Nga aiuana, kaha asana vavusamba vendi nava valihata navo na kuvaleka nguendi, ‘Vuaheleleni hamo nange omuo njinaiuana mbongo yange ije njazimbalesele.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/>Njimileka nguange, mucifua cimo vene, muli kuvuahelela hakati katungelo va Njambi hali umo muka vupi uje atenguluka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muana ua kuzimbala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu uatualeleleleho kuhandeka nguendi, “Kuakele yala uakele navana va vamala vavali. <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/>Ua kanike uahandekele kuli ishe nguendi, ‘Tate, njihaneko mutambela ua vufuko vuange,’ kaha ishavo uavapangelele vufuko vuendi hakati kavo vana vendi vavali. <verse eid="LUK 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>Kukuahitile ntsimbu yailaha kuhuma haje, ua kanike ua mbate vioshe uakele navio na kuya ku lifuti lilahako na kupihisa viuma viendi vioshe kusenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/>Muamanusuile kupihisa viuma viendi vioshe, kaha kuakele njala mu lifuti lioshe, kaha uaputukile kutsa njala na vuhutu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/>Kaha uaile na kutonda vipangi kuli muntu umo uamu lifuti lije kaha ua mutualele ku lihia naku lisa vangulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/>Uatondele kulia vije vakele na kulia vangulu, vuno honi naumo uahi uamuhaneneko cimo ca kulia. <verse eid="LUK 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>Omo mana ahilukile muli ikeye, uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Vaka kupanga va vatate vali na viakulia viavingi, yange kuno njili nakutsa njala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/>Njikuta vungenzi njihiluke kuli tate kaha njikahandeka kuli ikeye nguange, “Tate, njapihisila Njambi nove, <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/>kunjapandele naua kunjisana munove, njipuise kupua umo uava Vaka kupanga vove.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/>Kaha uakatukile nakuya kuli ishe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Omo uakele nakuendela kulako, ishe ua mumuene kaha ua muivuililile cikeketima kaha ishe uamushatukilile, uamuvumbatele na kumutsuemba. <verse eid="LUK 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>Muana uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Tate njapihisila Njambi nove. Kunjapandele naua kunjisana munove.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>Vuno honi ishe uahandekele kuli vangamba vendi nguendi, ‘Zambuleni! Neheni cikovelo cacili mumuzike nakumuzika kanzeya ku munie uendi na vinkaku ku viliato yendi. <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/>Neheni muna ngombe uakuhindala mumutsihe, kaha tulieni na kuvuahelela, <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/>omuo munange ou uatsile vuno honi nahinduka naua, uazimbalele vuno honi nauaniua.’ Kaha vaputukile kulia na kuvuahelela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>“Ha ntsimbu ijevene, muana ua mukuluntu uakele mulihia. Omo uezile hayehi na njivo, uovuile miaso na vakakukina. <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/>Kaha uasanene umo ua vangamba na kumuihula vika ‘vili nakulingika.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/>Uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Ndumbuove neja kaha isho natsihi muana ngombe uakuhindala omuo nahiluka oku alimuacili.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>Muana ua mukuluntu ua nienguele na kuviana kukovela mu njivo. Kaha ishe uatuhukile na kumulambelela akovele mu njivo. <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/>Vuno honi uakumbuluile ishe nguendi, ‘Tala! Ha miaka yoshe njinakupangela ngue ndungo kaha kunjashauile mashiko ove. Vuno honi kuuanjihaneko cipue muna mpembe linga njivuahelele na vavusamba vange. <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/>Vuno honi omo ou munove nahiluka, uje na pihisa vufuko vuove na vukoyi kaha neja kuimbo, kaha una mutsihila muana ngombe uakuhindala!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>Ishe uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Munange, ntsimbu yoshe unakele nange, kaha vioshe njilinavio vinapu viove. <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/>Vuno honi tuapande kuvuahelela na kujolela, omuo shongoyove ou uatsile kaha nayoyo naua, uazimbalele vuno honi nauaniua.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca muka Kutulika uakuzangama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Kuakele yala umo ua kufuka uje uakele na muka kutulika vufuko vuendi. Muka kufuka uje vamulekele nguavo muka kutulika vitenga viove hali nakupihisa vimbongo viove. <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/>Kaha uamusanene na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Vika evi njili nakuivua hali yove? Njihane vukaleho vua viuma vioshe muje munatulikilamo vufuko vuange, omuo kukapu naua muka kutulika uange.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>Muka kutulika ualihandekesele ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Nga muene uange anjihumisa vipangi, njilinga vatihoni? Kunjesi na nzili yakuhinda vina, nganjihuma vipangi kuno, kaha naua njili na shuamua yakulomba. <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/>Kaha honi njatantekeya vinjikalinga linga vantu vakanjitambule mu vinjivo viavo! Omo vipangi viange vikahua.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>Kaha uasanene vantu vaje vakele na mikuli kuli muene uendi. Uehuile uakulivanga nguendi, ‘Vungahi uakonguele kuli muene uange?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Vihita vitanu na vitatu via mingomo ya mazi a olive.’ Kaha uje muka kutulika uahandekele naua nguendi, ‘Livulu liove eli lije limuesa makongo ove, tumama ha mavu sonekamo viseteko via vihita viuana via mingomo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>Kaha uehuile mukuavo ua mucivali nguendi, ‘Uakonguele cingahi?’ Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Cihita cimolika ca masaka a tiliku,’ kaha uamulekele nguendi, ‘Ambata livulu liove eli sonekamo makumi atanu na atatu a masaka a tiliku.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>Kaha uje muene uendi uashangazalele uje muka kutulika uakuhona kulongua hakukala na mana, omuo vantu va lifuti lino vatantekeya muakukela navakuavo kupulakana vana vamu ceke.” <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/>Njimileka nguange, pangeseni vufuko vua ha mavu kulinga vusamba kuli yeni na tuhutu. Kaha omo vufuko vueni vukahua, omo mukatsa vaka mitambula mu vihela via kuhona kuhua. <verse eid="LUK 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>Uoshe akala na vusunga muvia vindende na mu viakama akakala na vusunga, kaha uje kakala na vusunga muvia vindende kaha kakakala na vusunga mu viakama. <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/>Kaha nga kuuakele na vusunga na vufuko vua ha mavu, iya honi akutsiliela na vufuko vua vusunga? <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/>Kaha nga kuuakele na vusunga ha vitenga via muntu, iya akakuhana vufuko vuje vuakupande?<verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>“Uahi ngamba asa kupangela vamiene vavali omuo uje ngamba akazindaho umo naku zangaho mukuavo, cipue halihanako kuli umo na kushaula mukuavo. Kuuasa kupangela Njambi na vimbongo.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vihandeka vimo via Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mateu11:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mako10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Vafaliseo vaje vapuile vaka kuzanga vimbongo, omo vovuile vioshe evi, kaha vashendumuine Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vaje vaka limuesa kupua vaka vusunga ku vantu, vuno honi Njambi atantekeya mitima yeni, omuo coshe cije vashangazala hakati ka vantu, ku mesho a Njambi cinapu ca ngoco ngoco.<verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>“Lishiko lia Mosesa na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi vatuamenene vantu noho Iuano muka kumbuitika uezile. Kuhuma oho naha ntsimbu ino muzimbu uacili ua vumuene vua Njambi vauambulula. Muntu uoshe alinakueseka cikuma kukovela omu mu vumuene. <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/>Vuno honi cacasi melu na mavu kuhita kupulakana ka lizi kakande kamu mukanda ua Lishiko lia Mosesa kuhua.<verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>“Uoshe akondola mpuevo yendi na kuambata ueka nalingi vupangala, kaha uoshe ambata mpuevo uakukondola kuli yala liendi alinga vupangala.<verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yala ua kufuka na Lazalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>“Kuakele yala umo uakufuka uje uakele nakuya vuzalo vua vunengu vuandando yakutula, uakele na ciuano ca kulia cakama halitangua na tangua. <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/>Kuakele yala uacihutu lizina liendi Lazalu uje ivakele nakuneha ku cikolo ca muka kufuka, uje uakele na vimbandu muvila uoshe. <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/>Lazalu uakele nakuvandamena kulia viakele na kuua ku mesa ya uje yala uakufuka, na tutali vakele nakuija na kuliasa ha vimbandu viendi. <verse eid="LUK 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>Uje yala uacihutu uatsile kaha tungelo vamuambate kukakala na Avilahama. Kaha na uje yala uakufuka naikeye uatsile kaha vamutsindile. <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/>Uakele mu ngehena na kuyanda. Uatalele kuilu kaha uamuene Avilahama kulahako hali na Lazalu ku mukulo uendi. <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/>Kaha uasanene nguendi, ‘Tate Avilahama, njizivileko cikeketima tuma Lazalu ambuitike munie uendi mu mema anjitontuese ha ndaka yange, omuo njili na kuvua kuvavala muno mu tuhia.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>Vuno honi Avilahama uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Munange, anuka ha ntsimbu yove uakele nakuyoya uakele nakutambula viuma viove via cili, na ntsimbu ya Lazalu uatambuile via vipi, vuno honi hali nakuyoya muacili yove uli na kuyanda. <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/>Kaha naua mukati kove netu hali cina cakama, ngeci uoshe atonda kujavuka kuhuma kuli yetu kuija oko keti ase, kaha naumo uahi asa kujavuka kuhuma oko kuija kuno kutuli.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>Kaha yala ua kufuka uahandekele nguendi, ‘Honi, tate, njilomba yove utume Lazalu ku njivo ya tate, <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/>omuo njili na vandumbuange vatanu. Ecela Lazalu aye nakuvanangula linga keti vakeje naua kuno kucihela ca tuyando.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>Kaha Avilahama uakumbuluile nguendi, ‘Vali na visoneka via Mosesa na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi, vanapande kuvovuilila.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>Uje yala ua kufuka uahandekele nguendi, ‘houe, tate Avilahama, vuno honi nga umo akasanguka kuvatsi aya kuli vakevo kaha vakatenguluka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>Avilahama uamukumbuluile nguendi, ‘Nga kuvevuilila ku visoneka via Mosesa na tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi, kaha cipue muntu uakuhuma ku vatsi ku vakatava.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s">Vupi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mateu18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21">21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mako9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Viaseko via vupi mua vusunga vihita, vuno honi tuyando kuli uje avineha! <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/>Cacili kuli ikeye nga vaka mukutilila livue liakama muntsingo na kumumbila mu cisali, kuhona akovelese umo ua vanike vavandende mu vupi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/>Zangameni ku vije muli nakulinga. Nga mukueni alinga vupi munangule nga halitavela mukonekele. <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/>Kaha nga muntu umo vene akupihisila lutanu na luvali ha litangua limo, kaha eja kuli yove lutanu na luvali na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘njatenguluka,’ unapande kumukonekela.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutsilielo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Kaha tunganda vahandekele kuli Muene Yesu nguavo, “Vuezelela lutsilielo luetu!” <verse eid="LUK 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Kaha Muene Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Nga muli nalutsilielo lualundende ngue mbuto ya musalata, nge muasa kuhandeka ku muti ou uakama ua mizi yaingi ngueni, ‘Tukuka uka shimbame ha mema a kalunga!’ Kaha ukeuo ukamiononoka.<verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vipangi via ngamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>“Nga ulina ngamba muka kulima cipue muka kuniunga vampanga uasa kuhandeka kuli ikeye nga ahuminina ku mehia nguove, ‘Ija hano vene uakutumame na kulia’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/>Houe! Ukahandeka kuli ikeye nguove, ‘Vuahesa viakulia viange via cinguezi, Naua lizitikile vualumo muiva uove nakunjipangela noho njikalia na kunua, nga njamanesa ambahoni ulie na kunua!’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/>Honi ngamba kuveku mutsatsela hakulinga vije vivamushikile kulinga ndi? Mua vusunga kuahi! <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/>Neni naua vene, omo mualingile vioshe vije vivamishikile kulinga, handekeni ngueni, ‘Tuva ngamba vangoco, tunalingi lika vipangi vietu.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa vamala likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Yesu hakuya ku Yelusalema uahitile mukati ka Samhaliya na Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Kaha uakovelele muimbo muje vamala vambumba likumi vamuuanene, vemanene kulahako. <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>Vatambakanene cikuma na kuhandeka nguavo, “Yesu, Muene tuvuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Omo Yesu uavamuene, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni mukalimuese yeni vavenia kuli tusasendote.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Omo vakele nakuya vavalelesele. <verse eid="LUK 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Kaha umo uavo omo uamuene nguendi nakanguka, uahilukile na kushangazala Njambi na lizi liakama, <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Uauile na cihanga cendi ku viliato ya Yesu na kumutsatsela. Ikeye uapuile Kasamaliya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuvapuile likumi vanakanguka? Ava vatanu na vauana vali kulihoni? <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/>Vikahoni cipue umo kuija nakuhana cisantsela kuli Njambi kuvanga lika ou keti kayunda?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Katuka uye, lutsilielo liove lua kukanguisa.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija kua vumuene vua Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateu24:23-28</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Kaha Yesu vamuihuile kuli Vafaliseo nguavo, “Ntsimbu muka vumuene vua Njambi vukeja?” Kaha uavatavele nguendi, “Vumuene vua Njambi kuvukeja mungila ije muasa kuvumona na mesho eni kuahi. <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/>Kukuesi akahandeka nguendi, ‘Tala, vuno vulikuno!’ Cipue ‘Taleni, vuje vuli kuje!’ Omuo vumuene vua Njambi muli navuo hakati keni.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Kaha honi Yesu uahandekele kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Matangua akeja omo mukatonda kumona litangua limo lia Muna Muntu, vuno honi kumukasa kuli mona. <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/>Kaha kukakala vamo vakahandeka kuli yeni nguavo, ‘Taleni ali kuje!’ Cipue, ‘Taleni ali kuno!’ Keti muyeko, keti muvakavangeye. <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/>Ngue muhiato mukahiatula muilu, kaha vaumona uhuma kumuhela umo ua lilu nakuya ku muhela ukuavo ua lilu, mukemovene naua Muna Muntu muakafua ha litangua liendi liakuhiluka. <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/>Vuno honi napande kuyanda cikuma na kumuyengula kuli vantu va ntsimbu ino. <verse eid="LUK 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>Nge mucapuile ku matangua a Noua mukemovene mucikapuilamo naku matangua a Muna Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/>Vantu vakele nakulia na kunua, na kuliambata na kushombuesa, noho Noua uakovelele mu vuato. Kaha livazi liezile nakuvanongesa voshe. <verse eid="LUK 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>Nge mucapuile ku matangua a Lote: vantu voshe vanuine, valile, valandesele na kulandulula, vakunine na kutunga, <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/>vuno honi ha litangua lije Lote uahumine mu Sondoma, tuhia na mavue vianokele ngue mema a kuhuma muilu, kaha via vanongesele voshe. <verse eid="LUK 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>Cikapua ngue mujevene ha litangua liakasholoka Muna Muntu.<verse eid="LUK 17:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/>“Ha litangua lijevene, uoshe uje yala hali helu lia njivo keti akovele mu njivo na kuambata viuma viendi, naua na uje hali mu lihia liendi keti ahiluke ku njivo yendi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/>Singaniekeni hali mpuevo ya Lote. <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/>Voshe vaje vatonda kuniunga muono uavo vavenia vaka uzimbalesa, vuno honi vaje vazimbalesa muono uavo vakau uana. <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/>Njimileka, ha vutsiki vuje kukakala vantu vavali ha muhela umo, umo vakamuambata ou mukuavo vakamuseza. <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/>Kaha kukakala vampuevo vavali vali mukutua hamo mucini cimo, mukuavo vaka muambata na mukuavo vakamuseza.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/>[Vamala vavali vakapanga mu lihia, umo vakaya nendi mukuavo vakamuseza.]<verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Kaha vandongisi vendi vamuihuile nguavo, “Kulihoni kuvikalingika, Muene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Kaha Yesu uavatavele nguendi, “Kuoshe kuje kuli civimbi kukeko kukalikunguluila makuvi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Ntuluue na muka Kuyula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi cisimo eci kuvalongesa nguendi, vapande kulombela ntsimbu yoshe cakuhona kuecela. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Uahandekele nguendi, “Mu mbonge imo muakele muka kuyula uje kateuele Njambi cipue kusingimika vantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/>Kaha naua mu mbonge ijevene muakele ntuluue uje uakele nakuija kuli ikeye vintsimbu viavingi na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘njihaneko kapandi kange ha vitozi vange!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>Ha ntsimbu yaindende uje muka kuyula uavianene, hajevene uahandekele kuli ikeye vavenia nguendi, ‘Cipue kunjiteue Njambi cipue kusingimika vantu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/>vuno honi ou ntuluue nanjishupu cikuma, njapande kumuhana kapandi kendi, omuo nga atualelelaho kuija kaha aka njihonesa!’”<verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Kaha Muene Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Ivuilileni vije viahandeka uje muka kuyula uakuhona vusunga! <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/>Nkuma Njambi kasa kuyula mu vusunga ku vantu vendi vaje valinakulilila kuli ikeye vutsiki na mutania? Nkuma ngueni akasimbula mukuvakuasa ndi? <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/>Njimileka nguange, hajevene akavahana kapandi kavo. Vuno honi omo Muna Muntu akeja, akauanaho vantu vali nalutsilielo hano ha mavu ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca Kafavaliseo na muka kutambula lisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yesu uate cisimo eci naua kuli vantu vaje vaka kutsiliela vusunga vuavo vavenia nakushaula vakuavo, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/>Uahandekele nguendi, “Vamala vavali vayile ku njivo ya Njambi nakulomba, umo Kafaliseo, mukuavo muka kutambula lisimu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/>Kafaliseo uemanene na kulomba nguendi, ‘Njikutsantsela Njambi, yange kunjafuile ngue vakuetu vantsintsa, vaka kuhona vusunga, vaka vupangala. Yange kunjafuile ngue uje muka kutambula lisimu nemana kuje. <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/>Njikaliumina kulia ha matangua avali mu simano, njikahana cimo kulikumi ca vioshe vinjikauana.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>Vuno honi uje muka kutambula lisimu uemanene ku lahako, kaha kasele cipue kutala kuilu, vuno honi ualivete ha ntulo na kuhandeka nguendi, ‘Njambi, civuile cikeketima yange muka vupi.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>Njimileka,” nguange, “uje muka kutambula lisimu uaile kuimbo liendi mu vusunga kupulakana uje Kafaliseo, voshe vaje valijundula vakevo vavenia vaka vakehesa, vuno honi voshe vaje valikehesa vakevo vavenia vakava jundula.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuisula vanike vavandende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateu19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mako10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Vantu vanehelelele Yesu vanike vavandende linga avasaleke mavoko, kaha omo vandongisi vendi vacimuene, vesekele kuvindika vaje vantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Vuno honi Yesu uasanene vanike vavandende veje kuli ikeye, uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni vanike vavandende veje kuli yange keti muvavindike, omuo vumuene vua Njambi vuli ku vantu ngue ava vanike vavandende. <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/>Mua vusunga njimileka nguange, uoshe uje katambula vumuene vua Njambi ngue kanike uamundende, kakakovela mu vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yala ua kufuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mako10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Litangua limo umo mukuluntu ua Vayunda uehuile Yesu nguendi, “Mulongisi uacili, vika njinapande kulinga linga njikauane muono uakuhona kuua?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Vika unjitumbuila nguove uacili?” Naumo uahi “uacili kuvanga Njamba lika. <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/>Uatantekeya mashiko a Njambi nguauo, ‘Keti ulinge vupangala, keti utsihe, keti uive, keti uvangeye mukueni vukaleho vua makuli, singimika isho na noko.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Kaha uje yala uakumbuluile Yesu nguendi, “Mashiko oshe aua njaononoka laja hume kuvuanike vuange.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Kaha omo Yesu uevuile evi, uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kunasupila cuma cimo ciunapande ku linga. Ya ukalandese vioshe viulinavio kaha ukahane vimbongo vioshe kuli tuhutu, kaha ukakala na vufuko muilu, kaha uije, uakunjikave.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Vuno honi uje yala omo uevuile evi, kaha uanienguele, omuo ikeye uakele navufuko vua vuingi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Omo Yesu uamuene nguendi naniengua, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “cinapu cacikalu kuli vaka kufuka kukovela mu vumuene vua Njambi! <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/>Cacikalu kuli kamelu kukovela mu lisho lia nguya vuno honi cacikalu cikuma kuma muntu muka kufuka kukovela mu vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Kaha vaje vantu vovuile, vamuihuile nguavo, “Iya honi akovoka?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Kuli viuma vije vantu kuvasa kulinga vuno honi Njambi asa kulinga coshe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Kaha Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Tala! Yetu tunaseza vioshe vituli navio, nakukukava.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Eyo, mua vusunga njimileka uoshe uje naseza njivo yendi, cipue mpuevo yendi, cipue munaina, cipue visemi vendi, cipue vana vendi, omuo vumuene vua Njambi, <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/>akatambula viavingi cikuma mu muono ou na muono ua yaye mu miaka ije ikeja kulutue.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka ntsimbu ya mucitatu a kutsa cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateu25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu uatualele vandongisi vendi likumi na vavali kuavo lika, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Evuilileni! Tulinakuya mu Yelusalema kuje viuma vioshe vije vivasonekele kuli tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi hali Muna Muntu linga vika lishulisise. <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/>Muna Muntu vakamuhana ku mavoko a Maloma vaje vaka mushendumuna na kumutuka na kumujekuila malenzi. <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/>Vaka muveta, kaha vaka mutsiha, vuno honi munima ya matangua atatu akasanguka.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Vuno honi vandongisi vendi kuvovuisisile nacimo cahi ha viuma evi, omuo kulumbunuka kua mezi aua vavashuekeleleuo linga keti vatantekeye vije via handekele Yesu kuli vakevo.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akanguisa yala ua kapuputua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mako10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Omo Yesu uahete kuyehi na Yeliko, kuakele yala umo ua kapuputua uakele kumukulo ua ngila nakulomba. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Kaha omo uevuile civunga ca vantu cili nakuita, kaha uehuile nguendi “Vika vili nakulingika?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Kaha vamulekele nguavo, “Yesu uaku Nazaleta hali nakuhita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Kaha uatambakanene nguendi, “Yesu! Muna Ndaviti! Njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Kaha vantu vaje vakele kulutue lia civunga, vamulekele linga aholoke. Vuno honi ikeye uatambakanene cikuma nguendi, “Ove Muna Ndaviti! Njivuileko cikeketima!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu uemanene nakushika nguendi, “Muneheni kuno”. Omo uje yala uashuenene kuyehi, Yesu uamuhulisile nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/>“Vika utonda linga njikulingile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Kaha uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene njitonda linga njimone naua.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Mona! Lutsilielo luove luna kukanguisa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Kaha hajevene uaputukile kumona, uakavele Yesu, na kushangazala Njambi. Omo vantu vacimuene, kaha voshe vashangazalale Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Sangeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Hanima yevi Yesu kukovela mu Yeliko na kuputuka kuhitanganamo. <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>Muakele yala umo mu mbonge ije, uje uapuile mukuluntu ua vaka kutambula lisimo lizina liendi Sangeo, uje uapuile muka kufuka. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Uatondele kumona Yesu, vuno honi kasele kumumona omuo uapuile uamuihi, kaha naua kuakele civunga cakama. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Kaha uashatukilile kulutue lia civunga, ualondele ku muti ua linongo linga amone Yesu uje uahitilile mu ngila ijevene. <verse eid="LUK 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Omo Yesu uahete ha mutambela uje, uatalele kuilu, kaha uahandekele kuli Sangeo nguendi, “shuluka vuasi Sangeo, omuo lelo njapande kuija ku njivo yove.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Sangeo uashulukile vuasi na kumutambula na kuvuahelela cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Vantu voshe vaje vamuene vialingiuile vaninguile nguavo, “Ou Yala nai kupua mungezi ku njivo ya muka vupi!” <verse eid="LUK 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Kaha Sangeo uemanene na kuhandeka kuli Muene Yesu nguendi, “Muene ivuilila njihana mutambela ua vufuko vuange kuli tuhutu, nga njambate cimo kuli umo mu ngila ya makuli, kaha njika mufueta vintsimbu viuana.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuovoka ku neja mu njivo muno lelo, omuo yala ou nalimuesa kupua muana ua vusunga ua Avilahama. <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/>Mua vusunga Muna Muntu uezile nakutonda na kuovola vaje vana zimbala.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca mbongo ya Ngolinde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Tele vantu vakele nakuivuilila vije Yesu uakele nakuhandeka, uavatele cisimo omuo uakele kuyehi na Yelusalema, kaha vasinganiekele nge vumuene vua Njambi hajevene vuavuno vusholoka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Kuakele muntu uaku vumuene uje uaile ku lifuti lia kulahako linga vakamupuise muene, hanima yevi uasinganiekele kuhiluka linga akuendese vantu vendi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/>Tele kanda aye, uasanene vangamba vendi likumi kaha uahanene umo na umo mbongo ya ngolinde na kuvaleka nguendi, ‘Landululeni noho njikeja.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>Vuno honi vantu vamu lifuti liendi vamuzindile cikuma, kaha vatumine tunganda vamukave munima yendi na kukahandeka nguavo, ‘Ou yala kutumutondo linga apue Muene yetu kuahi.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>“Omo uje yala uahilukile, hanima ya kumuhaka kupua muene, uashikile vaje vangamba vahanene vimbongo linga veje kuli ikeye linga atantekeya cingahi vana landuluilaho. <verse eid="LUK 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>Kaha uakulivanga uezile nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo imolika ije iuanjihanene yasemuininahoni vimbongo likumi vikuavo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Unalingi muacili cikuma, ngamba uacili! Kaha muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, omuo unakala nalutsilielo mu viuma viavindende, njikakuhana nzili yakama ya kutuamenena vimbonge likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>Kaha uamucivali naua uezile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo yove imolika ije iuanjihanene yasemuinina vimbongo vitanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>Kaha naua muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Njikakupuisa muka kutuamenena vimbonge vitanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>Kaha mukuavo ngamba uezile uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene, mbongo yove eyi, hanga njaitulikilile akantanga kakandende. <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/>Njakutinine, omuo yove uapua muntu uavutenu. Ukambata cije keti cove na kuteja vije kuuakuvile.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>Kaha muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Yove ngamba uamupi! Njikakuhisa na mezi akuhuma mu kanua kove! Utantekeye nguove yange nji yala uavutenu, njikambata vije keti viange na kuteja vije kunjakuvile? <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/>Vikahoni kuua yakele kuli vaka kusekasana mbongo yange? Omo yange njineja nge njinauana mbongo yange hamo na kakondueso kayo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>Kaha muene uahandekele kuli vaje vemanene kumukulo nguendi, ‘Muniekeni oyo mbongo, muihane kuli uje hali na vimbongo likumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>Vuno honi vakevo vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, ‘Muene, hali laja na vimbongo likumi!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>Kaha ikeye uavatavele nguendi, ‘Muavusunga njimileka nguange, uje hali naco, vakamuhakelako viavingi, vuno honi uje kesi navio, cipue vene vije viavindende viali navio vakamuniekavio. <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/>Kaha honi ku vitozi vange, vaje kuvatondele linga yange njipue muene uavo, vaneheni kuno nakuvatsihila ha mesho ange.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akovela na vumpau mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mako11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Iuano12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Omo Yesu uamanesele kuhandeka evi, kaha uaile kulutue luavo nakuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Omo Yesu uahete kuyehi na Mbetefenje na Mbeteniya ku munkinda ua Oliveta, kaha uatumine vandongisi vavali kulutue, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/>Uavalekele nguendi, “Yeni ku limbo lije lili kulutue lueni, omo mukakovelamo mukauana muna cimulu vanamukutu, uje kanda muntu alondeho. Kaha muzituleni mumunehe kuno.” <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/>Nga muntu umo amihula nguendi vika mumuzituila, mulekeni ngueni Muene amutonda.<verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Kaha vaje vatumine vaile vakauanene muje muahandekelele Muene. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Tele vali nakuzitula uje muna cimulu, kaha vavenia cimulu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika mumuzituila ou muna cimulu?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Kaha vamutavele nguavo, “Muene hali nakumutonda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Kaha vatualele uje muna cimulu kuli Yesu. Kaha vajalele tuzaku tuavo ha muongo ua cimulu, kaha valondeseleho Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Omo uakele nakuya ha cimulu, vantu vajalele tuzaku tuavo mu ngila kulutue lua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Omo Yesu uahete kuyehi na Yelusalema, kucikulo ca munkinda ua Oliveta, kaha civunga cacingi ca vandongisi vendi vaputukile kuvuahelela na kulemesa Njambi na mezi akama ha vikomoueso vioshe viakama vivamuene vije Yesu ualingile, <verse eid="LUK 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>nguavo “Uakukuisula muene uje akeja mu lizina lia Muene Njambi! Ciyulo cikale muilu na vumpau kuli Njambi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Kaha Vafaliseo vamo vaje vakele mu civunga vahandekele kuli Yesu nguavo, “Mulongisi, shika vandongisi vove vaholoke”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu uavatavele nguendi, “Njimileka nguange, nga ava valikela kulemesa kaha aua mavue akaputuka kutambakana.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alilila Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Omo Yesu uahete kuyehi na kumona Yelusalema, uailililile, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/>uahandekele nguendi, “Nga uatantekeyele lika lelo nguove vika vitondeka linga kukale ciyulo! Vuno honi vuavuno vacishuekesa ku mesho ove! <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/>Ntsimbu ikeja hali yove, omo vitozi vove vaka kutungila cimpaka, nakukuhaka mukati kavo, na kukushetuilamo mukati ku mitambela yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/>Kaha vakevo vakakunongesa hamo na vantu vove vaje vali mu vivumbe viove, kuvakaseze livue limo mu muhela ualio, omuo yove kuuatantekeyele ntsimbu omo Njambi uezile nakukuovola.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aya mu njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:12-17">Mateu12:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mako11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Iuano2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yesu uakovelele mu njivo ya Njambi, na kuputuka kushekamo voshe vaje vakele na kulandesa, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/>uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vanasoneka mu visoneka nguavio, ‘Njivo yange ikapua njivo ya Malombelo’, vuno honi yeni muaipuisa muhela ua vizi!”<verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi ha litangua na litangua. Vakuluntu va tusasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na vantuama va vantu vatondele kumutsiha, <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>vuno honi kuvauanene ngila yaku cilingila, omuo vantu voshe vakele naku muvuilila linga keti vasezeho cipue lizi limo.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s">Cihula caha nzili ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mako11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Litangua limo Yesu uakele nakulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi na kuambulula muzimbu uacili ku vantu, kaha vakuluntu va tusasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa, hamo na vakuluntu vezile. <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Tuleke, nzili muka ukalikuasesa nayo kulinga viuma evi? Iya nakuhana nzili eyi?” <verse eid="LUK 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Nange naua njimihula cihula cimo. Njilekeni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/>nzili ya likuasesele Iuano muka kumbuitika ya humine kuli Njambi indi kuli vantu?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Vaputukile vimpata hhakati kavo nguavo, “Vika tuhandeka? Nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘ya humine kuli Njambi,’ kaha akatuihula nguendi, ‘Vikahoni kumua mukulahelele Iuano?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Vuno honi nga tuhandeka nguetu, ‘Ihuminina ku vantu,’ Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu vakatutsiha mukutuasha mavue, omuo vovuisisile nguavo Iuano uapuile Kananguizi ua Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Kaha vakumbuluile Yesu nguavo, “Kututantekeya kuje kuya humine.” <verse eid="LUK 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Nange naua kunjimileke kuihuminina nzili injili nakulikuasesa kulinga viuma evi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cisimo ca vaka kupanga mu citungu ca Viniu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mako12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Kaha Yesu uaputukile kuleka vantu cisimo eci nguendi, “Kuakele yala umo uakele na citungu ca mikolovozi ya vushuka vua viniu, kaha uacikumuisile kuli vandimi vamo, kaha uaile vungezi vuendi ha ntsimbu yalaha. <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/>Omo ntsimbu ya kuteja vushuka yahete, uatumine ngamba uendi kuli vaje vandimi, muku katambulako mutambela uendi kuli vije vanateje. Vuno honi vaje vandimi vapupile uje ngamba, na kumuhiluisa mavoko voko. <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/>Kaha uje vavenia citungu uatumineko naua ngamba mukuavo, vuno honi vaje vandimi vamupupile na kumulinga mua mupi, kaha uamuhiluisile mavoko voko. <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/>Uatumineko naua ngamba uamu citatu, kaha vaje vandimi vamu vulumuine naua nakumumbila hambaza lia citungu. <verse eid="LUK 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>Kaha honi vavenia citungu uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njilinga vati? Njikatuma munange injazanga, hamo vaka musingimika!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>Vuno honi omo vandimi vamumuene, kaha valihandekesele hhakati kavo nguavo, ‘Ou ikeye muna uje vavenia citungu. Ijeni tumutsihe, kaha tukafungulula vufuko vuendi!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/>Nkuma, vamumbilile hambaza lia citungu, kaha vamutsihile.” Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vika akalinga uje vavenia citungu kuli vaje vandimi? <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/>Akeja na kutsiha vaje vantu na kuhana cije citungu kuli vandimi veka.” Kaha omo vantu vavuile evi, vahandekele nguavo, “Mua vusunga vene keti ngoco kuahi!” <verse eid="LUK 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesu uavatalele nakuvehula nguendi, “Visoneka vilumbunuka vika omo vihandeka nguavio, ‘Livue lije livavianene vaka kutunga ngue kuliesi na seho likelio vuavuno linapu liaseho kupulaka mavue oshe’?<verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>Kaha uoshe uje akauila ha livue lije akapokoka, vuno honi nga lije livue lika uila hali muntu umo, likamusaniuna.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca kufueta lisimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mako12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Kaha valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa na tusasendote vayonguele kukuata Yesu haje vene, omuo vatantekeyele nguavo cisimo eci nacitela vakevo, vuno honi vateuele vantu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Nankuma, vatatele ntsimbu ya cili. Kaha vahanene lizika kanua kuli vantu vamo valipuise nge vaka vusunga, kaha va vatumine kuli Yesu linga vakamueseke na vihula linga vamuhane ku mavoko a Nguvulu ua Maloma. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Kaha vaje vavatumine vehuile Yesu nguavo, “Mulongisi tuatantekeya nguetu yove ukahandeka vusunga na kulongesa vusunga naua kuue kutala hali muntu cipue uapua ua vulemu, cipue keti ua vulemu vuno honi ntsimbu yoshe ukalongesa vantu vusunga muje muatondela Njambi vayoyemo. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Tuleke, nkuma Lishiko lietu litutavesa kufueta lisimo kuli Sezale indi kuahi?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Vuno honi Yesu uatantekeyela kuzangama kuavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/>“Njimueseni mbongo ya siliva. Cihanga ceya na lizina lieya viliho?” Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo “via Sezale!” <verse eid="LUK 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muacili, haneni kuli Sezale vije viapande kuli Sezale, kaha haneni kuli Njambi vije viapande kuli Njambi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Kaha kuvasele kumu uanenaho mulonga ha mezi aua ku mesho a vantu. Valikomokelele ku kukumbulula cendi kaha vaholokele kuluu.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula ca kusanguka ku vatsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Kaha Vasanduki vamo, vaje vakulahela nguavo vantu kuvakasanguka ku vatsi, vezile kuli Yesu nakumuihula nguavo, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Mulongisi, Mosesa uatusonekelele Lishiko eli nguendi, ‘Nga yala atsa, kaha aseza mpuevo yendi vuno honi kesi na vana, kaha munaina ambate uje ntuluue linga vakase kukala na vana va uje natsi.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Kuakele vamuanaye vatanu na vavali, kaha uje uamukuluntu uambate mpuevo, uatsile kuakuhona vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Kaha uje ua mucivali uambate uje mpuevo naua uatsile kuakuhona vana <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>kaha mucitatu naua. Cuma cimo cafuile mujevene kuli voshe vatanu na vavali, voshe vatsile kuakuhona vana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Kaha kukumanusuila uje mpuevo uatsile. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Nankuma, ha litangua lije omo vatsi vaka sanguka, uje mpuevo akapua ueya hhakati kavaje voshe vamuambate vatanu na vavali?” <verse eid="LUK 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vantu va lifuti lino vakambata na kushombuesa naua, <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/>vuno honi vampuevo na vamala vaje vapande kusanguka ku vatsi na kuyoya mu ntsimbu ije ikeja kulutue kuva kambata cipue kushomboka. <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/>Vakevo vakapua ngue tungelo kuvakasa naua kutsa omuo vanapu vana va Njambi, omuo vanasanguka kuvatsi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/>Mosesa nahana vukaleho linga vatsi vaka sanguka. Mu visoneka vije vihandeka via lifo liakele nakuuema Mosesa ahandeka hali Muene Njambi ikeye vene ‘Njambi ya Avilahama, Njambi ya Isake, na Njamba ya Yakomba.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/>Ikeye uapua Njambi ua vaka kuyoya, keti ua vaka kutsa kuahi, omuo ku mesho a Njambi voshe vantu vendi vayoya.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Kaha vamo valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vahandekele nguavo, “Mulongisi, uakumbulula muacili!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Kuhuma ha ntsimbu ije kuvasele naua kuihula Yesu vihula vieka.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cihula hali Kilistu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mako12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Vatihoni vali nakuhandeka nguavo, Kilistu akapua ua ku ntanga ya muene Ndaviti? <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/>Ndaviti vavenia nahandeka mu livulu lia miaso nguendi, ‘Muene Njambi uahandekele kuli Muene uange nguendi, Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio, <verse eid="LUK 20:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>noho njikapuisa vitozi vove ngue cituamo caku viliato viove.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>Ndaviti ikeye vavenia uamutumbuile nguendi, ‘Muene,’ vatihoni Kilistu apua mutekulu lia Ndaviti?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu anangula linga vazangame kuli Valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mako12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Kaha omo civunga ca vantu vakele nakuvuilia, kaha Yesu uakele nakuhandeka kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/>“Zangameni kuli valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa, vaje vazanga kuenda na vikovelo viavo via laha viandando na kutsetsela na kasingimiko mumihela yakulandesela na kuhangula vituamo viacili mu vinjivo via Njambi via malombelo na mihela ya vantu va vulemu ku viuano. <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/>Vakevo vakakuisi vantuluue na kuvevila vinjivo viavo, kaha vashueka vilinga viavo na malombelo alaha! Kaha nakuzangamesa kuavo kukapu kuakama cikuma!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s">Mulambu ua ntuluue</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mako12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Litangua limo omo Yesu uakele nakutalazeka, uamuene vaka kufuka vali nakuhana mulambu uavo mu njivo ya Njambi, <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>kaha naua uamuene ntuluue umo ua cihutu uahanene tumbongo tuvali. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Mua vusunga njimileka nguange, ou ntuluue ua cihutu nahana viavingi kupulakana voshe vaje vantu vakufuka, <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/>njahandeka evi omuo veka vanakala nakulambuila via kusalaho ku vufuko vuavo, vuno honi ou mpuevo nalambuila vioshe vianakele navio via kulikuasa navio.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka ha kunonga kua Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateu24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mako13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Vamo va vandongisi va Yesu vakele nakuhandeka ha njivo ya Njambi, ha vucili vua mavue aje vaitungisile, na vuana vuje vakele nakuhana mukuivuahesa, kaha Yesu uahandekele nguendi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/>“Maneni njimileke ha viuma vioshe evi munamono. Ntsimbu ikaheta omo vitozi veni vaka humisa livue lioshe lia njivo mu muhela uhalio, kaha mavue oshe a ka siuka.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyando na Mapakeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mako13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Vandongisi va Yesu vamuihuile nguavo, “Mulongisi, muaka muka evi viuma vikalingika?” Na cimueso muka tukatantekeya naco nguetu ntsimbu inahete ya viuma vioshe evi vilingiue. <verse eid="LUK 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Zangameni keti vamikuise. Vantu vavengi vakeja mu lizina liange na kuhandeka nguavo, ‘Yange vene ikeye!’ Kaha naua nguavo, ‘Ntsimbu inahete vuavuno!’ Vuno honi keti mukava kavangeye. <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/>Omo mukevua vizita na kulitengulukila, keti mukateue, viuma evi vinapande kulingika tahi, vuno honi kuvilumbunuka nge kuhua kua mavu kunahete.” <verse eid="LUK 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele naua nguendi, “lifuti likalua nzita na lifuti likuavo, kaha vumuene vukalua na vumuene vukuavo. <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/>Kukala mandundumua, na njala yakama, na mishongo ya kulitambuisa kuoshe, kukakala viuma viakuteuesa na vitantekeyeso viaku komouesa vikahuminina muilu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>Omo ntsimbu kanda viuma evi visholoke. Vakamikuata na kumiyandesa, vakamituala kuvi njivo via malombelo avo naku kamiyula naku mihaka mutumenga, kaha vakamituala ku vimiene naku vanguvulu mukunieseka omuo lizina liange. <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/>Ikapua ntsimbu yacili kuli yeni ya kuambulula Muzimbu ua Cili. <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/>Nankuma, vihakeni mu mitima yeni keti muvisinganiekele vualumo ngueni vika tukahandeka, <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/>omuo njikamihana mana akutantekeya vije vimukahandeka linga vitozi veni kuvakasa kumihisa cipue kuviana vimukahandeka. <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/>Cipue visemi vieni, na vamuanoko, na vavushoko veni na vavusamba veni vakamienda vungungu. Kaha vamo hhakati keni vaka vatsiha. <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/>Kaha voshe vakamizinda omuo lizina liange. <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/>Vuno honi cipue cinkambu cimo ca kumutue ueni ku cikazimbala. <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/>Takameseni, kaha mukohiela miono yeni.<verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka ha kunonga kua Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateu24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mako13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>“Omo mukamona Yelusalema vana izengeleka ku civunga ca masualale, tantekeyeni ngueni kunonga kuayo kuli muyehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/>Nankuma, vaje vali mu Yundeya vapande kuteuela ku minkinda, kaha vaje vali mu mbonge vapande kuhumamo, kaha Vaje vali hambaza ya mbonge naku mehia vapande keti vakovelemo mu mbonge. <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/>Aua akeuo matangua akuzangamesa, vivahandekele mu visoneka linga vilishulisise. <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/>Luvinda ku vampuevo vaje vakakala na mazimo na vampuevo vaje vaka jamuesa ha ntsimbu ije! Tuyando tuakama tukeja ha lifuti eli, na vukalu vua Njambi vukeja hali vantu ava. <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/>Kaha vamo vaka vatsiha na mukuale, kaha vakuavo vakavatuala ku vunzinda ku mafuti eka, kaha vaje keti Vayunda vaka pihisa Yelusalema noho ntsimbu yavo ikaheta.<verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija kua Muna Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mako13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>“Kaha viuma via kukomouesa vikapangiua ku litangua naku ngonde naku vingongonosi. Vantu voshe vaha mavu vakevua liova lia kuohia kua mema a kalunga na kukuma kua mankimba kaha kuvakatantekeya vivakalinga. <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/>Vantu vaka lezimuka kuliova omo vakatatela vije vikasholoka hano ha mavu oshe, omuo viuma vioshe via muilu vikalininganga. <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/>Kaha vakamona Muna Muntu akeja mu mashuelua na nzili na vumpau vuakama. <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/>Omo viuma evi vikaputuka kupangiua, katukeni nanzili na kutala kuilu, omuo kuohela kueni kuli hayehi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cilongesa ca muti ua mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mako13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Kaha Yesu uavatelele cisimo eci nguendi, “Singaniekeni ha muti ua mukuyu na miti yeka yoshe. <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/>Omo mumona mafo auo aputuka kuzovelela, muapande kutantekeye ngueni ntondue ili muyehi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/>Kaha mucifua aci vene, omo mukamona viuma evi vipangiua mutantekeye ngueni vumuene vua Njambi vuli muyehi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>“Muavusunga njimileka, viuma vioshe evi vikapangiua oku vantu voshe va ntsimbu ino vaciyoya. <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/>Melu na mavu vikahita, vuno honi mezi ange kuakahiti.<verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muapande kutalelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>“Zangameni! Keti mushoshomue cikuma mitima yeni ha ciuano viakulia na kunua na kulinienga ha viuma vije via lifuti. Nga muvilinga litangua lije lika miniangumuna ngue mukapiluka muheto. <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/>Litangua lije likeja ku vantu voshe vali hano ha mavu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/>Livuaheseleni na kulombela ntsimbu yoshe linga mukakale na nzili yakuhiana vioshe vije vikapangiua na kuimana ku mesho a Muna Muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Yesu uakale na kulongesa mu njivo ya Njambi ha matangua aje, kaha kuheta ku ntsimbu ya cinguezi, uakele nakuhumamo na kuya ku munkinda ua Oliveta kukakalako vutsiki vuoshe. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Kucimenemene coshe vantu voshe vakele nakuya mu njivo ya Njambi na kumuivuilila.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua kutsiha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mako14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Iuano11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Omo ntsimbu yahete kuyehi ya ciuano ca kulia mbola ya kuhona cimbaluila, civasana nguavo Ciuano ca Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Kaha vakuluntu vatusasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vatondele ngila ya vushueke ya kutsilamo Yesu omuo vakele na liova lia vantu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yundasa atava kuenda Yesu vungungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mako14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Kaha Satana uakovelele muli Yundasa ivasana Sakaliote, umo uavaje likumi na vavali ua vandongisi. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Kaha Yundasa uaile na kukahande kuli vakuluntu vatusasendote na vaka kuniunga Njivo ya Njambi, uavamuesela ngila yakuendela Yesu vungungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Kaha vakevo vavuahelelele cikuma, valitaivatumbuile nendi kumuhana vimbongo. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Yundasa uatavele, kaha uatalazekele ngila imo ya kuendelamo Yesu vungungu kua kuhona vantu kutantekeya.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alivuahesela kulia kua ciuano ca Paseka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mako14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Iuano13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Litangua liete ha ntsimbu ya ciuano ca mbolo ya kuhona cimbaluila, omo vatsihile vana va vampanga vakulia ha Ciuano a Paseka. <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu uatumine Petulu na Iuano nguendi “Yemuye muka vuahesele vualumo mutu kalila Ciuano ca Paseka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Kuli ku utonda linga tuka civuaheleseko?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Omo mukakovela mu mbonge, muka uana muntu nambata njava ya kutekuila mema. Mukaveni noho akaheta mu njivo ya kakovela. <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/>Handekeni kuli vavenia njivo ngueni, ‘Mulongisi natutumu kukuihula nguendi, cilikuli cihela cituakulila yange na vandongisi vange Ciuano ca Paseka?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/>Kaha akamimuesa cihela cakama helu lia njivo, vanauvuahesa vualumo, kuje mukavuahese viakulia.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Kaha vaile vauanene viuma vioshe nge muavalekelele Yesu, vavuahesele viakulia via Ciuano ca Paseka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mesa ya Muene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mako14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolinte11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Kaha omo ntsimbu ya hete Yesu uatumamene ku mesa hamo na tunganda vendi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njatondele cikuma kulia eci Ciuano ca Paseka hamo neni ntsimbu kanda njiyande, <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/>omuo njimileka nguange, kuhuma lelo kunjikacili naua kuvanga noho calishulisilila muacili mu Vumuene vua Njambi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Kaha Yesu uanonele hambanza ya viniu, kaha uahandekele kuli Njambi, na kuhandeka kuli vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Ambateni hambanza eyi mulishumuine hhakati keni. <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/>Njimileka nguange, kuhuma lelo kunjikanu naua neni viniu kuvanga noho vumuene vua Njambi vuneja.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Kaha uambate naua mbolo uakandelele kuli Njambi, kaha uaitavuile uava haneneyo nguendi, “ Ei inapu muvila uange uvanahana ha yeni. Lingelingeni eci mukunjivuluka yange.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Omo vamanesele kulia uambate kambanza uahandekele nguendi, “Eyi kambanza inapu litavasano lihaliha lia Njambi livanakutu na maninga ange aje ahitikila hali yeni.<verse eid="LUK 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/>“Vuno honi taleni! Ou anjenda vungungu hali hamo nange kuno ku mesa! <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/>Muna Muntu akatsa nge muje muasinganiekelemo Njambi, vuno honi tuyando tuendi uje akamuenda vungungu!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Kaha vandongisi vendi vaputukile kulihozola hhakati kavo nguavo, iya honi akalinga cuma eci.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vimpata hali uje napu uakama kupulakana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Kaha kuaputukile vimpata hhakati ka vandongisi va Yesu nguavo, iya umo hhakati kavo napu uakama kupulakana. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Kaha Yesu uandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vamiene va vaje keti Vayunda vali na nzili ha vantu vavo. Kaha vaje vaka kushika vavatumbula vakuasi va vantu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/>Vuno honi ei keti ikeyo ngila hhakati keni, vuno honi uoshe uje uakama hhakati keni napande kupua uamundende, kaha ntuama yeni napande kupua ngue ngamba. <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/>Iya uakama kupulakana? Uje natumama kukulia cipue uje hamuhana viakulia? Nguetu uje natumama kukulia ikeye uakama ndi? Vuno honi yange njili hakati keni nguange muka kuhana viakulia.<verse eid="LUK 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/>Yeni munakala nange mu tuyando tuange tuoshe. <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/>Nge mua nanjihanena Tate nzili ya kuyula, neni naua njikamihana nzili yakuyula. <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/>Linga yeni mukalie na kunua mu vumuene vuange, kaha mukatumama ku vituamo vua vumuene na kuyula miyati likumi na ivali ya Isaleli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahandeka nge Petulu akamuviana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mako14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Iuano13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Simoni, Simoni! Ivuilila, Satana atonda linga amieseke yeni mu vavoshe, ku hangununa vacili ku vavapi nge muka kulima muaka hangununa tiliku ku mujungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/>Vuno honi yange njakulombelela linga lutsilielo luove keti luhue. Kaha omo ukatenguluka na kuhiluka kuli yange, unapande kukolesa vamuanoko.<verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Kaha Simoni Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, njalivuahesela laja kuya mu kamenga nove na kukatsa nove!”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Kaha Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga, Petulu” njikuleka nguange, “vutsiki vuno vene kanda ndemba atambeke, ukanjiviana lutatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Cikuama, Ngonga na Mukuale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Yesu uehuile vandongisi vendi nguendi, “Muje njamitumine cakuhona cikuama, ngonga cipue vinkaku muahonoueleko cuma cimo ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “houe!”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vuno honi” ntsimbu ino, “Ou hali na cikuama cipue ngonga napande kuambata, kaha uoshe nahonoua mukuale napande kulandesa kazaku kendi alande mukuale. <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/>Muomu vanacisoneka nguavo, ‘Vamutandelele kumo na vaka kushaula Lishiko.’ Kaha njimileka nguange eci cinapande kulishulisisa hali yange. Eyo vioshe vije vivanasoneka hali yange vili nakulishulisisa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Kaha vandongisi vahandekele nguavo, “Muene tala! Kuli mikuale ivali ei!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Kaha uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Mukemo vene!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Alombela ha munkinda ua Oliveta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mako14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Kaha Yesu uahumine mu mbonge, kaha uaile ku munkinda ua Oliveta nge muakele nakulingilamo. Kaha vandongisi vendi vamukavele. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Omo uahete kuje uavalekele nguendi, “Lombeleni linga keti mukovele muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Kaha uahumine kavundende kuli vakevo kaha uatsikamene na kulombela, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/>nguendi, “Tate nga mutonda hambanza eyi ya tuyando ihite kulahako nange. Keti nge ku cizango cange kuahi, vuno honi cizango cove cilingiue. <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Kangelo uahumine kuilu uasholokele kuli ikeye na kumusimpisa. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Omuo ha tuyando tuakama ua lombelele cikuma, kaha ntuima yendi yapuile ngue mambase a maninga anduekelele ha mavu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Kaha omo uakatukile kuhuma ku kulombela, uaile kuli vandongisi vendi uavauanene vanakosa tulo, omuo vazeyele na vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vikahoni muakosela? Hindukeni mu lombele, linga keti mukovela muvieseko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamukuata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mako14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Iuano18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Kaha te Yesu uakele nakuhandeka navo, hajevene civunga ca vantu cahete. Yundasa Sakaliote uje uava likumi na vavali uatuamene kulutue luovo. Kaha uashuenene kuli Yesu na kumuntsuemba. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Yundasa nkumani yove uenda Muna Muntu vungungu na kumutsuemba ndi?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Kaha omo vandongisi vaje vakele hamo na Yesu vamuene vije viapangikile vahandekele nguavo, “Muene tulikuasese mikuale ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Kaha umo ua vandongisi va Yesu uavatuile lituitui lia ngamba ua kasasendote uakama.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Vuno honi Yesu uamu vianesele nguendi, “Ecela” kaha uakuate lituitui lia uje yala nakulihiluisilako naua.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vaje vakuluntu va tusasendote na vamo vakuluntu va vaka kuniunga njivo ya Njambi na vakuluntu vaje vezile na kumukuata nguendi, “Nkumani muneja namikuale na vimbueti ngue njimuizi ndi? <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/>Njinakele neni mu njivo ya Njambi ha matangua oshe vikahoni kumuanjikuate. Vuno honi eyi ikeyo ntsimbu yeni yakuipanga, omo nzili ya milima ili nakuhiana.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu aviana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateu26:57-58</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 26:69">69</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 26:75">75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mako14:53</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:66">66</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 14:72">72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Iuano18:12-18</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Vakuate Yesu kaha vamutualele ku njivo ya Kasasendote uakama, kaha Petulu uamukavele munima uakele kulahako. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Vamo vavuekele tuhia mukati ka cipango vatumamene nakuota, kaha Petulu uatumamene navo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Omo ngamba umo uampuevo uamuene Petulu natumama kuje ku tuhia, uamutalele ntoma, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yala ou naua uakele hamo na Yesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Vuno honi Petulu uavianene nguendi, “Yove mpuevo yange kunjimutantekeya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Kaha omo kuahitile ka ntsimbu kakandende, yala ueka naua uamuene Petulu, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Nove naua ua umo vendi” Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yala, kuahi, keti yange!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Omo kuahitile ola lika, kaha yala mukuavo naua uahandekele nanzili nguendi, “Ou yala cilivene uakele hamo na Yesu, nendi naua Kangalileya!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove yala yange kunjitantekeya evi ulinakuhandeka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Hajevene te acili nakuhandeka kaha ndemba uatambekele. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Kaha Yesu uatengulukile uatalele kuli Petulu, kaha Petulu uavulukile vije via mulekele Yesu nguendi, “Ntsimbu kanda ndemba atambenge vutsiki vunovene ukanjiviana lutatu” <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Kaha Petulu uatuhukile hambanza na kulila cikuma.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Vamushendumuna na Kumupupa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateu26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mako14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Vamala vaje vaniungile Yesu vamushendumuine na kumupupa. <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>Vamukitile tanga ha mesho, kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Nga ukananguizi, tuleke! Iya na kupupu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Vahandekele viuma viavingi via kumushaula.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vasompesa Yesu ku mesho a mpunga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateu26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mako14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Iuano18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Kaha omo kuacele vakuluntu voshe va vantu valiuanene hamolika. Vakuluntu va tusasendote, na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa voshe kuvakele, kaha vanehele Yesu ku mpunga yavo. <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>Kaha vamuihuile nguavo, “Tuleke, yove Kilistu ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Kaha Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Cipue nga njimileka nguange yange, kumukanjikulahela.” <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/>Kaha naua nga njimihula cihula, kumukasa kunjitava. <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/>Vuno honi hume lelo nakutuala kulutue Muna Muntu akatumama ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi muka nzili yoshe.<verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Kaha voshe vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma yove u Muna Njambi ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ikeye uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Mumu nahandeka mukemo vene.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Vikahoni tutondela naua vukaleho vueka? Yetu vavenia tualivuila laja muanacihandeka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Nguvulu Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateu27:1-2</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mako15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Iuano18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Kaha mpunga yoshe yakatukile na kutuala Yesu kuli Nguvulu Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Kaha vaputukile kumuvangeya nguavo, “Tuauana ou yala aleka vantu vetu linga valuise Fulumende yetu, alina kuvavindika kufueta lisimu kuli Sezale na kulihandeka ikeye vavenia nguendi ikeye Kilistu Muene uetu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Kaha Pilato uamuhulisile nguendi, “Yove Muene ua Vayunda ndi?” Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Munahandeka mukemo vene.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Kaha Pilato uahandekele ku tusasendote vakama na civunga nguendi, “Yange kunjauanene mulonga kuli ou muntu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Vuno honi vakevo vahandekele na nzili nguavo, “Ikeye alinakulinga mpindakano ku vantu na vilongesa viendi linga valuise Yundeya yoshe. Uaputukilile mu Ngalileya, kaha hano vene nejakuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala kuli Muene Helonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Omo Nguvulu Pilato uevuile eci, kaha ueuile nguendi, “Nkuma ou yala ka Ngalileya ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Omo Pilato uatantekeyele nge Yesu uahumine ku nganda ije yakele nakuyula Muene Helonde naua mukemo muakele, kaha uamutumine kuli Muene Helonde, uje uakele mu Yelusalema ha ntsimbu ije. <verse eid="LUK 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Muene Helonde uavuahelele cikuma omo uamuene Yesu, omuo uovuile viendi na laja uakele nakutonda cikuma kumumona. Uakele nalishungu lia kumona Yesu alinga vikomouesa. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Kaha Muene Helonde ueuile Yesu vihula viavingi, vuno honi Yesu katavele cipue lizi limo. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Kaha vakuluntu va tusasendote na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko lia Mosesa vaile kulutue nakuvangeya Yesu muakama. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Kaha Muene Helonde na masualale vendi vamushendumuine naku mupanga mua mupi, kaha vamuzikile mukanjo uandando, kaha Helonde vamuhiluisile kuli Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Kaha ha litangua lije vene Helonde na Pilato valikuate vusamba, te kanda lievi vapuile muntu na citozi cendi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamusompela kutsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mako15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Iuano18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">Iuano19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Pilato uasanene hamo vakuluntu va tusasendote na vantuama na vantu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muanehe ou yala kuli yange na kuhandeka ngueni alinakulekesa vantu linga valuise Fulumende. Ivuilileni, yange njamuihuile ku mesho eni, kaha kunjauanene mulonga ua cuma cimo cacipi cimunamuvangeya. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Cipue Helonde kauanene mulonga muli ikeye mukemo namuhiluisa kuli yetu. Ou yala kukuesi cuma canalingi linga va muuaneneho mulonga ua kutsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Njikamupupa lika kaha njikamuecela linga aye.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Kuakele cilika cavo cije Pilato uatondele kuhumisila vantu cinzinda umo mu kamenga uje ivatondele ha ntsimbu ya Ciuano ca Paseka.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu ca tambakanene nguavo, “mutsihe!” Tuzituile Mbalambasa. <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>(Mbalambasa vamuhakele mu kamenga omuo uakele nakuluisa Fulumende mu mbonge na kuntsiha vantu.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Vuno honi Pilato uatondele kuecela Yesu, kaha uahandekele naua ku civunga. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Vuno honi vakele nakutambeka nguavo, “Mushukike ha cilindakano! Mushukike ha cilindakano!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Kaha Pilato uahandekele naua lua mucitatu nguendi, “Vupi muka vuanapanga? Yange kunjauanene cuma cimo ca kumutsihila! Njimupupa lika na kumuecela aye.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Vuno honi vantu vatualeleleho kutambeka nguavo Yesu vamushukike ha cilindakano, kaha hakutambeka nguavo uavahaneneye. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Nankuma, Pilato uatete cije cimpande, ngue muvalombele vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Kaha Pilato uecelele Mbalambasa muntu ivatondele, uje uakele mu kamenga ha mulonga ua kuluisa Fulumende na kutsiha vantu. Kaha uavahanene Yesu linga vamulinge muje muvatondelele vavenia.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu va mushukika ha cilindakano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mako15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Iuano19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Kaha masualale vatualele Yesu mukumushukika te vali nakuya valiuanene na yala umo ua lizina lia Simoni uaku Silene, uje uezile mu mbonge kuhuma ku mehia. Kaha vamukuate nakumutuika cilindakano ca Yesu kaha vamulekele linga akave Yesu munima. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Civunga cakama ca vantu ca mukavele, hhakati kavo hakele vampuevo vaje vakele nakulilila ikeye cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu uatengulukile kuli vakevo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yeni vampuevo vamu Yelusalema! Keti mulile yange vuno honi lilileni yeni vavenia na vana veni. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/>Kaha matangua alina kuija omo vantu vakahandeka nguavo, ‘Vanakuisuliua vaje vantsimpi, vaje kuvasemene tukeke na vaje kuvalelele.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/>Ikapua ntsimbu ije vantu vakahandeka ku minkinda nguavo, ‘Tuuileni! Naku malundu nguavo, tufuikeni!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>Nga valinga viuma evi ku muti uakutontola, kaha honi cikafua vati ku muti uakuma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Kaha naua kuakele mihuza vavali va vamala vavatualele hamo na Yesu na kuvashukika. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Omo vahete kumuhela vatumbuile nguavo, “Cikola,” kaha vashukikile Yesu ha cilindakano na vaje mihuza vavali umo ku livoko lia cilio mukuavo ku livoko lia cimoshue. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu uahandekele nguendi, “Tate vakonekele! Omuo kuvatantekeya cije civali nakulinga.” Kaha masualale valipangezelele vuzalo vuendi na kuta nkela. <verse eid="LUK 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Kaha vantu vemanene kuje nakutalela te vantuama va Vayunda vamushendumuine nguavo, “Uovuele vakuavo, nendi aliovole ikeye vavenia nga ikeye Kilistu uje ya nahangula Njambi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Kaha masualale vamushendumuine naua vezile hayehi kuli ikeye vamuhanene viniu via kushasha. <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>Vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Liovole yove vavenia nga u Muene ua Vayunda!” <verse eid="LUK 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Helu lia cilindakano cendi hakele mezi aua nguavo, “Ou ikeye Muene ua Vayunda.” <verse eid="LUK 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Kaha muhuza umo ivamushukikile hamo nendi uahandekele lizi lia kumushaula nguendi, “Nkumani keti yove Kilistu ndi? Liovole yove vavenia netu naua utuovolo!” <verse eid="LUK 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Kaha uje mukuavo muhuza uamutenukilile nguendi, “Nkuma yove kuuteue Njambi ndi? Yove unambata cihiso ngue ikeye. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Cihiso cetu cinatupande, omuo tunambata fueto ya vilinga vuetu, vuno honi yala ou kesi na vupi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli Yesu nguendi, “Yesu njivuluke omo ukeja mu vumuene vuove.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Mua vusunga njikuleka nguange lelo vene ukakala hamo nange mu vumuene vua muilu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mako15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Iuano19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Omo ntsimbu yapuile hhakati ka litangua, kaha litangua liazivalele kuakekele milima mu lifuti lioshe ije yakeleko noho ha ola ya citatu ya cinguezi. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Kaha ntanga ije yakele mu njivo ya Njambi yatavukile hhakati kuhuma kuilu na mavu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Kaha Yesu uatambekele na lizi liakama nguendi, “Tate! Njihaka muono uange mu mavoko ove.” Hanima yakuhandeka mezi aua uatsile. <verse eid="LUK 23:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Omo mukuluntu ua masualale uamuene vije via lingiuile, ualemesele Njambi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Mua vusunga yala ou uapuile muka vusunga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Omo vantu vaje vakungulukilile kuje ku muhela vamuene viuma vije valingiuile, kaha vahilukile ku vinjivo viavo vali pupangele ha vintulo viavo mu vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Kaha voshe vaje vatantekeyele Yesu ha mutuntu uendi hamo na vampuevo vaje vamukavele kuhuma ku Ngalileya vemanenene kulahako nakutala viuma evi.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vatsinda Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mako15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Iuano19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Kuakele yala umo lizina liendi Yosefa uaku mbonge ya Alamatiya mu nganda ya Yunda. Uapuile yala uacili ua kasingimiko, <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>uje uakele nakutalelela kuija kua vumuene vua Njambi. Cipue vene uapuile umo uamu mpunga, katavele ku vutumbe vuavo vua kuluisa Yesu na vilinga viavo. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Uaile kuli Pilato nakulomba muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Uahumisile muvila ua Yesu ha cilindakano, kaha uauzengelele ha ntanga ya liniu, kaha ualangekele muvila ua Yesu mu cihilo cije civa cokuele mu livue lije kanda vantsindemo muntu kuyehi na munkinda uaundende. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Liapuile litangua lia mucitanu cinguezi omo litangua lia Sapalalo kanda lihete. <verse eid="LUK 23:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Vampuevo vaje vakavele Yesu kuhuma ku Ngalileya vaile hamo na Yosefa, vakamuene cihilo cije na kumona muje muvalangekelelemo muvila ua Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Kaha vaile ku vinjivo viavo nakukavuahesa mukundu na mazi aluengo luacili linga vaka vuahese muvila ua Yesu. Kaha ha litangua lia Sapalalo vahuimine kuya ku Lishiko lia Mosesa.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s">Kusanguka kua Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateu28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mako16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Iuano20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Omo kuacele lia calumingo vampuevo vaile ku cihilo, vambate mazi avavuahesele. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Kaha vauanene livue liakama vana lihumisa ku cikolo ca cihilo. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Kaha vakovelelemo vuno honi kuuanenemo muvila ua Muene Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Vemanene kuje te valikomokela, kaha hajevene kuasholokele vamala vavali mu vuzalo vuakuviakuma kuli vakevo. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Vaje vampuevo vovuile liova cikuma kaha vakotamene ha mavu, vaje vamala vavehuile nguavo, “Vika mutondela muka muono ku vantsi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Uahiko kuno nasanguka laja. Vulukeni muje muahandekele kuli yeni tele ali ku Ngalileya. <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/>‘Muna Muntu vaka muhana mu mavako a vantu vavupi, kaha vaka mushukika, a kasanguka hanima ya matangua atatu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Kaha vampuevo vavulukile mezi endi. <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>Kaha vahumine kuje ku cihilo vakalekele viuma vioshe vivamuene kuli vaje likumi na umo lia vandongisi na vakuavo voshe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Vaje vampuevo vapuile Maliya Mangandalena, na Njuana, na Maliya vaina ya Yakomba na vampuevo vakuavo valekele evi viuma kuli tunganda va Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Vuno honi tunganda vasinganiekele nge vije vivahandekele vampuevo keti viaseho kaha kuva vakulahelele. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Vuno honi Petulu uakatukile na kushatukila ku cihilo, uakotamenenemo kaha uamuenemo lika vintanga na ceka cahi. Kaha uahilukile kuimbo na kulikomokela ha viuma vije via lingiuile.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuenda kuya kulimbo lia Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mako16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ha litangua lijevene vandongisi vavali va Yesu vendele kuya ku limbo lije liivatumbuile nguavo Emausi, ntunda yakele matambo likumi na imo kuhuma ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Vakele nakuhandeka ha viuma vioshe vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Tele vacili nakuhandeka na kuliyongola, Yesu uezile hayehi navo nakuenda navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Vamumuene vuno honi kuvamutantekeyele. <verse eid="LUK 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vimpande muka muli nakuhandeka oku muenda?” Vemanene kaha vihanga viavo viasolokele mu vusiua. <verse eid="LUK 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Kaha umo uavo lizina liendi Kolopase, uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove lika mungezi muno mu Yelusalema uje katantekeya vinapangika ha matangua ano.”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Kaha uavehuile nguendi, “Viuma muka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Vamutavele nguavo, “Via Yesu uaku Nazaleta. Yala ou uapuile kananguizi ka Njambi na vantu voshe vamutavele kupua muka nzili mu viuma vioshe uahandekele na vije via lingile na Njambi uamu kulahelele. <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>Kaha tusasendote vakama na vakakuyula vamuhanene kuli Nguvulu ua Maloma linga vamutsihe, kaha vamushukikile ha cilindakano. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Tuakele na likulahelo nguetu ikeye akapatula Isaleli! Kaha lelo linapu litangua lia mucitatu kuhuma haje vialingiuile viuma evi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Vampuevo vamo hhakati ketu vatukomokesele, vamenekelele ku cihilo cimenemene, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>vuno honi kuvakauanene muvila uendi. Kaha vahilukile nguavo vakamuene cimona ca tungelo vaje vavalekele nguavo hali nakuyoya. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Kaha vamo hakati ketu vaileko ku cihilo, kaha vakauanene nge muje muvahandekelele vaje vampuevo, vuno honi kuvamumuene.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Kaha Yesu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vilema, vaka kusimbula kutsiliela vije vioshe vivahandekele tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/>Nkumani Kilistu kapande kuyanda ha viuma evi nakukovela mu vumpau vuendi ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Kaha Yesu uaputukile kuvalumbuinina vioshe viuma vije vahandekele mu visoneka hali ikeye, kuputuka na mavulu a Mosesa na kutuala ku visoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi voshe.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Kaha omo vahete kuyehi na limbo kuje vakele nakuya, Yesu ualingile ngue atuvakana kamandende kuya kulutue, <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Vuno honi vamulombele na kuhandeka nguavo, “Tumama netu omuo cinguezi na litangua liatoko.” Kaha uaile na kukala navo. <verse eid="LUK 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Uatumamene navo mukulia kaha uambatele mbolo naku ikuisula uaipazuile na kuvahana. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Kaha mesho avo ashokolokele vatantekeyele nguavo nkumani ikeye, vuno honi ualavukile ku mesho avo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Kaha valihandekesele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkumani mukemo mitima yetu yovuile kuvuahelela cikuma omo uakele nakuhandeka netu mu ngila na kutulumbunuina viuma viamu visoneka.”<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Vakatukile ha ntsimbu ijevene vahilukile ku Yelusalema, vauanene vandongisi likumi na umo vanalikungulula na vaje vakuavo veka naua. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Vahandekele nguavo, “Mua vusunga vene Muene Yesu nasanguka! Nalisholola kuli Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Kaha vaje vavali vambuluile vije vialingiuile mu ngila, nomu vatantekeyele nguavo nkuma ikeye Muene Yesu omo uatavuile mbolo.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alisholola kuli vandongisi vendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mako16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Iuano20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Vilinga1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Tele ntsimbu vaje vavali vakele nakuvaleka viuma evi, vuasi vuasi Yesu vavenia uemanene hakati kavo uahandekele nguendi, “Ciyulo cikale neni.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Kaha vovuile liova cikuma, omuo vasikaniekele nguavo vanamono ndumba ya muntu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Vuno honi uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vikahoni munalijujukila? Omo vika muli na vimpata mu mitima yeni? <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/>Taleni mavoko ange na mu viliato viange. Taleni yange vene. Njikuateni, kaha mutantekeya omuo nduma ya muntu kakele na ntsitu na vitsiha ngue evi muomono njili navio.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Uahandekele evi na kuvamuesa mavoko na viliato viendi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Cipue ngoco kuva kulahelele omuo vavuahelele cikuma na kulikomokela kaha Yesu uavehuile nguendi, “Muli na viakulia linga njilie ndi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Kaha vamuhanene mbazuvuila ya intsi uakuoca. <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>Kaha uaitambuile na kulia ha mesho avo.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Evi vikevio viuma vije njamilekele omo njakele neni nguange viuma vioshe vije vasonekele hali yange mu Lishiko lia Mosesa, na visoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi va Njambi na mu miaso viapande kulishulisisa.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Kaha uashokoluele mana avo linga vovuisise visoneka <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>na kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Visoneka viahandeka nguavio, Kilistu napande kuyanda kaha akasanguka hanima ya matangua atatu.” <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/>Visoneka viahandeka naua nguavio linga kualuluka na lukonekelo lua vipi vaka viambulula mu lizina liendi ku mafuti oshe, kuputukila mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/>Yeni munapu muvakaleho ha viuma evi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/>Kaha yange njikatuma Cimbembesi Cakulele kuli yeni cije cakulahesele Tate. Muapande kuvandamena mu mbonge noho mukatambula nzili ei kuhuminina muilu.<verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala muilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mako16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Vilinga1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Kaha uahumine navo mu mbonge uavatualele kuyehi na Mbeteniya kuje uajunduile mavoko endi naku vakuisula. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Tele hali nakuvakuisula, ualisezele navo nakumutuala muilu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Vamushangazalele kaha vahilukile mu Yelusalema na kuvuahelela cikuma. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Kaha vakele ntsimbu yoshe mu njivo ya Njambi na kusantsela Njambi.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
